msgstr "一株弹道真菌从地上长了出来。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You can't grow an oklob plant there."
msgstr "你不能在那里培育奥克罗布植物。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "An oklob plant grows from the ground."
msgstr "一株奥克罗布植物从地上长了出来。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You continue winding your clockwork bee..."
msgstr "你继续为发条蜜蜂上弦……"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Without a target, your clockwork bee falls to the ground."
msgstr "由于没有目标，你的发条蜜蜂落到了地上。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Without a target and with nowhere to land, your clockwork bee falls apart in a shower of cogs and coils."
msgstr "由于没有目标，也无处着陆，你的发条蜜蜂散成了一阵齿轮与弹簧雨。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your bee fails to deploy!"
msgstr "你的发条蜜蜂未能部署！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your bee can only target hostiles."
msgstr "你的发条蜜蜂只能以敌对生物为目标。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your existing bee falls apart."
msgstr "你已有的发条蜜蜂散架了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You need a visible target to rewind your bee! (Use ctrl+direction or * direction to deconstruct it instead.)"
msgstr "你需要一个可见目标才能为发条蜜蜂重新上弦！（使用 ctrl+方向键 或 * 方向键可将其拆解。）"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You lack sufficient magical power to recharge your bee."
msgstr "你没有足够魔力为发条蜜蜂重新充能。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your paragon expends all of its energy in an overwhelming flurry of blows!"
msgstr "你的白金典范倾尽能量，发动了一连串压倒性的攻击！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your paragon attacks with you!"
msgstr "你的白金典范与你一同攻击！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your paragon has reached its maximum power!"
msgstr "你的白金典范已达到最大力量！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your paragon is now ready to unleash a masterful attack."
msgstr "你的白金典范已准备好发动精妙的攻击。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "The grapnel guides your strike."
msgstr "抓钩引导着你的攻击。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You furiously retaliate!"
msgstr "你愤怒地反击！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "The last of your unstable energy dissipates and you return to your previous form."
msgstr "最后一丝不稳定能量消散了，你恢复了原先的形态。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You feel the transmutational energy in your body is nearly expended."
msgstr "你感觉体内的变形能量即将耗尽。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You revel in your kill!"
msgstr "你为这次杀戮而狂喜！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You raise your head to howl, but no sound comes out."
msgstr "你仰头试图嚎叫，却发不出声音。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You let out a blood-chilling howl!"
msgstr "你发出令人胆寒的嚎叫！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You feel invigorated."
msgstr "你感到精神振奋。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "The flame cauterises the wound!"
msgstr "火焰烧灼并封住了伤口！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You draw in some of the released energy."
msgstr "你吸收了部分释放出的能量。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "Your divine stamina protects you from poison!"
msgstr "神圣体魄保护你免受毒素侵害！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "A spider bursts forth from the wound!"
msgstr "一只蜘蛛从伤口中钻了出来！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "Your doom draws closer."
msgstr "你的末日更近了。"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "You emit a cloud of foul miasma!"
msgstr "你释放出一团污秽瘴气！"

msgctxt "log.melee-attack"
msgid "Your spellmotor activates!"
msgstr "你的法术引擎启动了！"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "You can't pick that up."
msgstr "你无法拾取它。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "You can't carry that many items."
msgstr "你无法携带这么多物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "There are no items here."
msgstr "这里没有物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "There are no objects that can be picked up here."
msgstr "这里没有可拾取的物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "There are several objects here."
msgstr "这里有几件物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "Unfortunately, you learned nothing new or useful."
msgstr "遗憾的是，你没有学到任何新的或有用的知识。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "You have collected all the runes! Now go and win!"
msgstr "你已集齐所有符文！现在去赢得胜利吧！"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "Press } to see all the runes you have collected."
msgstr "按 } 查看你已收集的全部符文。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "You feel the abyssal rune guiding you out of this place."
msgstr "你感觉深渊符文正指引你离开这里。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "Press } and ! to see all the gems you have collected."
msgstr "按 }，再按 !，查看你已收集的全部宝石。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "That is permanently installed in your exoskeleton."
msgstr "它永久安装在你的外骨骼上。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "You will have to take that off first."
msgstr "你必须先脱下它。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "Too many items on this level, not dropping the item."
msgstr "本层物品太多，无法丢下这件物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "No item to drop."
msgstr "没有可丢弃的物品。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "Sorry, no books on that skill today."
msgstr "抱歉，今天没有关于该技能的书。"

msgctxt "log.items"
msgid "That parchment doesn't seem to exist."
msgstr "那张羊皮纸似乎不存在。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "You are unable to access your magic!"
msgstr "你无法动用魔法！"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "Something interferes with your magic!"
msgstr "某种力量干扰了你的魔法！"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "Magical energy flows into your mind!"
msgstr "魔法能量涌入你的脑海！"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "Confirm with . or Enter, or press ? or * to list all spells."
msgstr "按 . 或 Enter 确认，按 ? 或 * 列出全部法术。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "You can't see any susceptible monsters within range! (Use <w>Z</w> to cast anyway.)"
msgstr "你看不到范围内有可受此法术影响的怪物！（仍要施法请按 <w>Z</w>。）"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "You lose access to your magic!"
msgstr "你无法再动用魔法了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "Sorry, this spell works on others only."
msgstr "抱歉，这个法术只能对他者施放。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "Malevolent energies surge around you."
msgstr "恶意的能量在你周围涌动。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "You stop channelling waves of flame."
msgstr "你停止引导火焰波。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "You stop channelling your searing ray."
msgstr "你停止引导灼热射线。"

msgctxt "log.spl-cast"
msgid "The insufficient charge dissipates harmlessly."
msgstr "尚未充足的电荷无害地消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "That is beyond the maximum range."
msgstr "那里超出了最大射程。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You call forth a pillar of damnation!"
msgstr "你召出一道天谴柱！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "A swirling arc of seething chaos appears!"
msgstr "一道旋转翻涌的混沌弧光出现了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The momentum dissipates harmlessly."
msgstr "动能无害地消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Bitter cold erupts, blasting rock from the ceiling!"
msgstr "刺骨严寒爆发，将岩石从天花板上轰落！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You can't deconstruct that!"
msgstr "你无法解构它！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "A door shatters!"
msgstr "一扇门粉碎了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "An iron grate is ripped into pieces!"
msgstr "一道铁栅被撕成碎片！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The dungeon shakes!"
msgstr "地下城震动起来！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The dungeon rumbles!"
msgstr "地下城隆隆作响！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "There is a shattering impact!"
msgstr "一声猛烈的碎裂冲击响起！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your fire resistance burns away!"
msgstr "你的火焰抗性被烧掉了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You erupt in a fountain of uncontrolled magic!"
msgstr "失控的魔法从你身上喷涌而出！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You feel like your blood is boiling!"
msgstr "你感觉血液仿佛在沸腾！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The poison in your system burns terribly!"
msgstr "你体内的毒素猛烈燃烧起来！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The poison in your system burns!"
msgstr "你体内的毒素燃烧起来！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You are no longer poisoned."
msgstr "你不再中毒了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The air bursts into flame!"
msgstr "空气燃烧起来！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The lightning grounds out."
msgstr "闪电导入大地，消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The air crackles with electrical energy."
msgstr "空气中电光噼啪作响。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Electricity surges outward!"
msgstr "电流向外奔涌！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You reach out to the water around you and turn it against your foes!"
msgstr "你操纵周围的水，让它们攻向你的敌人！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You exhale a blast of multi-hued devastation!"
msgstr "你吐出一股色彩斑斓的毁灭气息！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You begin to radiate toxic energy."
msgstr "你开始散发剧毒能量。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your toxic radiance grows in intensity."
msgstr "你的剧毒辐射变得更强了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Poisonous fumes billow in the air!"
msgstr "有毒烟雾在空中翻涌！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your wave of flame reaches its maximum intensity and dissipates."
msgstr "你的火焰波达到最大强度后消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You finish channelling your searing ray."
msgstr "你完成了灼热射线的引导。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "A cannonade of hail descends around you!"
msgstr "密集的冰雹轰落在你周围！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You erupt in a blast of force!"
msgstr "一股强大的冲击从你身上爆发！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "There are no walls around you to affect."
msgstr "你周围没有可影响的墙壁。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The walls around you are covered in ice."
msgstr "你周围的墙壁覆上了冰霜。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You can't see anything to vaporise!"
msgstr "你看不到可汽化的目标！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You begin accumulating electric charge."
msgstr "你开始积聚电荷。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your charge dissipates without a target."
msgstr "由于没有目标，你积聚的电荷消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You feel charge building up..."
msgstr "你感觉电荷正在积聚……"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "There are no places for you to create a bog."
msgstr "没有适合你创造沼泽的地方。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You spew toxic sludge!"
msgstr "你喷出有毒污泥！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Electricity arcs towards the magnetite!"
msgstr "电弧跃向磁铁矿！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You conjure up an array of volatile reagents!"
msgstr "你造出一组不稳定的试剂！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your magical reserves are too exhausted to conjure more reagents."
msgstr "你的魔力储备太过匮乏，无法造出更多试剂。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Flasks of reagents rain from above!"
msgstr "试剂瓶从上方如雨落下！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "Your rain of reagents ends."
msgstr "你的试剂雨结束了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You unleash the spiteful dead!"
msgstr "你释放出满怀怨恨的亡者！"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "The last of your harvested death is exhausted."
msgstr "你收集的死亡能量已全部耗尽。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You have harvested as much death for Grave Claw as you can hold at once."
msgstr "你为坟墓之爪收集的死亡能量已达储存上限。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You have harvested enough death to cast Grave Claw an additional time."
msgstr "你收集的死亡能量足以额外施放一次坟墓之爪。"

msgctxt "log.spl-damage"
msgid "You steady yourself in place and focus your resilience into a mighty blast."
msgstr "你站稳脚步，将坚韧之力凝聚成一次强大的冲击。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your familiar is too far away to imbue with magic."
msgstr "你的魔宠离得太远，无法为其灌注魔力。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You call for your canine familiar and it appears with a howl!"
msgstr "你呼唤犬类魔宠，它伴着嚎叫现身！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You imbue your familiar with magical energy and its fangs glint viciously."
msgstr "你为魔宠灌注魔法能量，它的獠牙闪出凶光。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A prickly colossus appears in a rush of desert wind."
msgstr "一个遍身尖刺的巨像在沙漠狂风中现身。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You aren't wearing any armour!"
msgstr "你没有穿着任何防具！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A chill wind blows around you."
msgstr "一阵寒风在你周围吹起。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You call out to the draconic realm, and the dragon horde roars back!"
msgstr "你呼唤巨龙的国度，群龙以咆哮回应！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A dragon tries to answer your call, but you don't have enough magical power!"
msgstr "一条巨龙试图回应你的呼唤，但你的魔力不足！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A dragon arrives to answer your call!"
msgstr "一条巨龙应你的呼唤而来！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A dragon appears."
msgstr "一条巨龙出现了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You are momentarily dazzled by a brilliant light."
msgstr "一道耀眼的光芒令你短暂目眩。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You can't see a target there!"
msgstr "你看不到那里有目标！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You create some ball lightning!"
msgstr "你造出了球状闪电！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "An electric hum fills the air."
msgstr "空气中充满电流的嗡鸣。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You bind the heart of a blast furnace in slag iron."
msgstr "你将高炉的核心束缚在炉渣铁中。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A tiny devil pulls itself out of the air."
msgstr "一只小魔鬼从空气中钻了出来。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Somewhere, a butterfly flaps its wings."
msgstr "某处，一只蝴蝶扇动了翅膀。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You hear the flapping of tiny wings."
msgstr "你听见微小翅膀的扑动声。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Wisps of shadow whirl around you..."
msgstr "缕缕暗影在你周围盘旋……"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "The shadows disperse without effect."
msgstr "暗影消散了，没有产生任何效果。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "The dungeon shakes, a horrible noise fills the air, and a portal to some otherworldly place is opened!"
msgstr "地下城震动，可怕的声音充斥着空气，一扇通往异界的传送门打开了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You open a gateway and unleash terrible monstrosities upon the world."
msgstr "你打开一道门户，将可怕的怪物释放到世间。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A forested plane collides here with a resounding crunch!"
msgstr "一个森林位面伴着震耳的撞击声，与这里相交！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "An evil force gathers, but it quickly dissipates."
msgstr "一股邪恶力量聚起，却很快消散。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You cannot haunt those who bear you no hostility."
msgstr "你不能对不怀敌意的生物施放鬼魂缠身。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You call forth a shade to shield your allies."
msgstr "你召出一道幽影，保护你的盟友。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You recall your battlesphere and imbue it with additional charge."
msgstr "你召回作战球，并为其补充能量。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You imbue your battlesphere with additional charge."
msgstr "你为作战球补充能量。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You conjure a globe of magical energy."
msgstr "你造出一颗魔法能量球。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your battlesphere expends the last of its energy and dissipates."
msgstr "你的作战球耗尽最后的能量，消散了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Your battlesphere wavers and loses cohesion."
msgstr "你的作战球摇晃着散开了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You feel your bond with your battlesphere wane."
msgstr "你感觉与作战球的联系正在减弱。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "That's too far away."
msgstr "那里太远了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You can't conjure that within a solid object!"
msgstr "你不能在实体物体内部造出它！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You can't place the prism on a creature."
msgstr "你不能把棱镜放在生物身上。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You call forth a plague of scarabs!"
msgstr "你召来一场圣甲虫灾！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A briar patch grows up from the ground."
msgstr "一片荆棘丛从地上长了出来。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something you can't see blocks your briars from growing!"
msgstr "你看不见的某物阻碍了荆棘生长！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "That space is already occupied."
msgstr "那个位置已被占据。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something you can't see occupies that space!"
msgstr "你看不见的某物占据了那个位置！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something you can't see is occupying that space!"
msgstr "你看不见的某物正占据着那个位置！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "There is not enough space to conjure foxfire!"
msgstr "没有足够空间造出狐火！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Flames leap up around you!"
msgstr "火焰在你周围升腾！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "There's no space to create foxfire here."
msgstr "这里没有空间造出狐火。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something unseen is already there!"
msgstr "那里已经有看不见的东西了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You can't make simulacra of that!"
msgstr "你不能用它制作冰骸！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "There's no room!"
msgstr "没有空间！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something prevents your mortar from forming!"
msgstr "某物阻止了你的迫击炮成形！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "There's no room for the soul wisp to form!"
msgstr "没有空间让灵魂幽火成形！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You see nothing there to target."
msgstr "你看不到那里有可选定的目标。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "If you tried to rewind gears in your present state, you'd only break them."
msgstr "以你现在的状态尝试重新上弦，只会弄坏齿轮。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You try to forge sawblades, but something it already there!"
msgstr "你试图锻造锯刃，但那里已经有东西了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You forge a whirling saw of razor-sharp crystal."
msgstr "你锻造出一片飞旋的锋利水晶锯刃。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You forge whirling saws of razor-sharp crystal."
msgstr "你锻造出数片飞旋的锋利水晶锯刃。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "Something unseen prevents your spell from working!"
msgstr "某个看不见的东西阻止了你的法术生效！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You craft a gleaming metal champion and it leaps into the fray!"
msgstr "你铸造出一位闪亮的金属勇士，它随即跃入战团！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A lumbering aparatus takes shape within a cloud of fumes."
msgstr "一台笨重的装置在烟雾中成形。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "The potion freezes solid before it can reach you!"
msgstr "药水还未到你面前，就冻成了固体！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You sigh wistfully at the memory of the taste."
msgstr "你回味着那种滋味，惆怅地叹了口气。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "But you're too far away!"
msgstr "但你离得太远了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You construct a shell of ice in front of yourself."
msgstr "你在面前构筑了一枚冰壳。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "A rock-encrusted egg appears nearby and begins to stir."
msgstr "一枚岩石包裹的蛋在附近出现，开始晃动。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You forge a skittering defender to stand by your side."
msgstr "你锻造出一个疾行的守卫，护卫在你身旁。"

msgctxt "log.spl-summoning"
msgid "You condense your magic into a crackling blade!"
msgstr "你将魔力凝聚成一柄噼啪作响的利刃！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You can't draw power from your own body while in death's door."
msgstr "处于死亡之门状态时，你无法从自身躯体中汲取力量。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Your body is bloodless."
msgstr "你的身体没有血液。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Your attempt to draw power from your own body fails."
msgstr "你试图从自身躯体中汲取力量，但失败了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You draw magical energy from your own body!"
msgstr "你从自身躯体中汲取魔法能量！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Malign forces permeate your being, awaiting release."
msgstr "恶意力量浸透你的全身，等待释放。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You dismiss your zombies and call upon the dead to rise afresh."
msgstr "你遣散已有的丧尸，呼唤亡者重新起身。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You call upon the dead to rise."
msgstr "你呼唤亡者起身。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Nothing appears to have answered your call."
msgstr "似乎没有什么回应你的呼唤。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You attempt to intoxicate your foes!"
msgstr "你试图让敌人陷入醉乱！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "The world spins around you!"
msgstr "你周围的世界天旋地转！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "There was nowhere nearby to inscribe sigils!"
msgstr "附近没有可铭刻符印的地方！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You inscribe a pair of binding sigils."
msgstr "你铭刻了一对束缚符印。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You inscribe a binding sigil."
msgstr "你铭刻了一枚束缚符印。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You slip past the binding sigil."
msgstr "你避过了束缚符印。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You move over the binding sigil and are bound in place!"
msgstr "你走过束缚符印，被束缚在原地！"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "You shape a spike launcher from a nearby wall."
msgstr "你用附近的墙壁塑造出一座尖刺发射器。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Your spike launcher falls apart as you grow too distant to maintain it."
msgstr "你离得太远，无法维持尖刺发射器，它散架了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-other"
msgid "Your spike launcher falls apart."
msgstr "你的尖刺发射器散架了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel jittery for a moment."
msgstr "你短暂地感到一阵不安。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You jump in place."
msgstr "你在原地跳了一下。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You jump through the air!"
msgstr "你纵身跃过空中！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "That's out of range!"
msgstr "那里超出了范围！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You tried to hop, but there was no room to land!"
msgstr "你试图跳跃，却没有落脚的空间！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You are hurled out of the way!"
msgstr "你被猛地甩到一旁！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You charge forward in eerie silence!"
msgstr "你在诡异的寂静中向前冲锋！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You charge forward with an electric crackle!"
msgstr "你伴着噼啪电光向前冲锋！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel the Orb interfering with your translocation!"
msgstr "你感觉宝珠正干扰你的位移！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Oops! There was something there already!"
msgstr "糟了！那里已经有东西了！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel strangely stable."
msgstr "你感到异样地稳定。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel space start to destabilise around you!"
msgstr "你感觉周围的空间开始变得不稳定！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel a distressing malevolence running through your instability!"
msgstr "你感觉不稳定之中流淌着令人不安的恶意！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel strangely unstable."
msgstr "你感到异样地不稳定。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel the power of the Abyss delaying your translocation!"
msgstr "你感觉深渊之力正延缓你的位移！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You feel the Orb delaying your translocation!"
msgstr "你感觉宝珠正延缓你的位移！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Your surroundings flicker for a moment."
msgstr "周围的景象闪烁了一下。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Your surroundings seem slightly different."
msgstr "周围的景象似乎略有不同。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Your surroundings suddenly seem different."
msgstr "周围的景象突然变了。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You can't see anything to attack."
msgstr "你看不到可攻击的目标。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You can't see anything you can safely attack."
msgstr "你看不到能安全攻击的目标。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Space momentarily warps into an impossible shape!"
msgstr "空间瞬间扭曲成不可能的形状！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You don't see anything to apport there."
msgstr "你看不到那里有可摄取的物品。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You cannot apport that!"
msgstr "你无法摄取它！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Not with that terrain in the way!"
msgstr "那里的地形挡住了去路！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "A magic seal in the Gauntlet prevents you from opening a passage!"
msgstr "竞技场中的魔法封印阻止了你开启通道！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You can't create a passage there!"
msgstr "你无法在那里创建通道！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You cannot create a passage on the other side of the transparent wall."
msgstr "你无法在透明墙壁的另一侧创建通道。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Creating a passage of Golubria requires sufficient empty space."
msgstr "创建格鲁布里亚通道需要足够的空地。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "The air shimmers briefly around you."
msgstr "你周围的空气短暂地闪烁。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You rattle the tambourine."
msgstr "你摇响了铃鼓。"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You speak a word of chaos!"
msgstr "你说出混沌真言！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "You see nothing there to target!"
msgstr "你看不到那里有可选定的目标！"

msgctxt "log.spl-transloc"
msgid "Space begins to contract around you, but something blocks your path."
msgstr "你周围的空间开始收缩，但某物挡住了你的去路。"

