#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Well, hello there."
msgstr "啊，你好。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Aren't you a tasty little thing?"
msgstr "你真是个美味的小东西，不是吗？"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "We're going to have a lot of fun together."
msgstr "我们在一起会玩得很开心。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Let's make your enemies cower, shall we?"
msgstr "让我们吓得你的敌人瑟瑟发抖，好吗？"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "You scratch my back, I'll scratch yours... and I'm one HELL of a backscratcher."
msgstr "你替我挠背，我也替你挠背……而我可是地狱级的挠背高手。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Another aspirant of the Dark Ways? We shall bring them all to heel together!"
msgstr "又一个追求黑暗之道的人？我们将携手令他们全都俯首称臣！"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "At last, a scion truly worthy of my power."
msgstr "终于来了一个真正配得上我力量的传人。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Finally, someone more useful than... these people."
msgstr "终于来了一个比……这些家伙更有用的人。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I knew you could not resist the dark call for long."
msgstr "我就知道，你抗拒不了黑暗的召唤太久。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I shall forgive your past transgressions, as long as you remember your place this time."
msgstr "只要这次记住自己的本分，我就宽恕你过去的过错。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I shall graciously assume that you are merely clumsy, not stupid."
msgstr "我会宽宏大量地当你只是笨拙，而非愚蠢。"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Don't test my patience; I have made greater than you beg for death over less!"
msgstr "别考验我的耐心；比你强得多的人，只因更小的过失，就被我折磨得求死！"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Finally..."
msgstr "终于……"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "You'll be back again, mark my words...."
msgstr "你还会回来的，记住我的话……"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Dare you to relinquish me? You shall regret this insult!"
msgstr "你竟敢舍弃我？你会为这番侮辱后悔的！"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "How arrogant, to think that any shield could be mightier than the power of Zonguldrok!"
msgstr "竟以为一面盾牌能胜过宗古多克的力量，何等狂妄！"

#. Reviewed source-a-01; canonical English identifiers remain unchanged.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-func.h
