#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "sonic wave"
msgstr "音波"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Sonic Wave: It radiates damaging sonic waves as it strikes, especially in combat involving dangerous or numerous foes."
msgstr "音波: 命中时放出能造成伤害的音波，面对危险或数量众多的敌人时尤为强烈。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "It causes slowness and exhaustion when equipped.\nIt extends the wielder's berserk rage when killing foes."
msgstr "装备时会造成迟缓和疲惫。\n杀死敌人时，会延长持有者的狂暴时间。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "chaos arc"
msgstr "混沌电弧"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Chaos Arc: It occasionally unleashes arcs of chaos on nearby creatures upon striking a foe."
msgstr "混沌电弧: 命中敌人时，偶尔会向附近生物释放混沌电弧。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Prune"
msgstr "普鲁恩"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Prune:     It halves damage taken while paralysed, petrified or unconscious."
msgstr "普鲁恩: 在麻痹、石化或昏迷时，使受到的伤害减半。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "rPois∞"
msgstr "毒免疫"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Envenom: If the wielder is skilled in Evocations, they can envenom those struck by it, dealing poison damage which bypasses armour."
msgstr "灌毒: 若持有者擅长唤发，可使命中的目标受到无视护甲的毒素伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Radiate: It can be activated via the 'a'bility menu to radiate toxic energy, with effectiveness depending on Evocations skill.\nAlch: It enhances your alchemy magic.\nrPois∞: It grants immunity to poison."
msgstr "毒能辐射: 可通过能力菜单（a）发动毒能辐射，效果取决于唤发技能。\n炼金: 增强你的炼金术。\n毒免疫: 使你免疫毒素。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Mindtap"
msgstr "汲念"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Mindtap:  Whenever a successful spell causes magic to be channelled from it, it may also drain additional magic from other enemies in sight, with a chance increasing with spell level."
msgstr "汲念: 成功施法并从中引导魔力时，也可能从视野内的其他敌人身上吸取额外魔力；几率随法术等级提高。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "megavamp"
msgstr "强效吸血"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Megavamp:  It occasionally heals its wielder for the full amount of damage dealt when it wounds a living foe."
msgstr "强效吸血: 伤害活物时，偶尔会按造成伤害的全部数值治疗持有者。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "curses,"
msgstr "诅咒,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Curses:    It inflicts powerful necromantic curses on any living foe it strikes."
msgstr "诅咒: 对命中的活物施加强大的死灵诅咒。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "torment"
msgstr "折磨"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Torment:   It occasionally torments all nearby living foes when it strikes in combat."
msgstr "折磨: 近战命中时，偶尔会折磨附近所有活着的敌人。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Hellfire:  It temporarily reduces the fire resistance of those it strikes."
msgstr "地狱火: 暂时降低命中目标的火焰抗性。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "+Damnation"
msgstr "+天谴"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "+Damnation: It grants the ability to hurl damnation at the cost of health and magic, with strength depending on Evocations skill."
msgstr "+天谴: 允许消耗生命与魔力投掷地狱火，强度取决于唤发技能。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Hellfire Court: It may summon demons of flame and damnation when striking foes."
msgstr "地狱火宫廷: 命中敌人时，可能召唤掌控火焰与天谴的恶魔。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "sticky flame,"
msgstr "黏附火焰,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Umbra"
msgstr "暗影光环"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Umbra:     It surrounds you with an aura of shadow, increasing your stealth and reducing the accuracy of all others within it."
msgstr "暗影光环: 使你笼罩在暗影气场中，增强你的潜行，并降低范围内其他所有生物的命中率。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "evervamp,"
msgstr "持续吸血,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Evervamp:  It heals its wielder for a portion of the damage dealt every time it strikes a living foe."
msgstr "持续吸血: 每次命中活物时，都按造成伤害的一部分治疗持有者。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "flash freeze,"
msgstr "瞬间冻结,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "execute"
msgstr "处决"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Execute:   It may instantly slay those it strikes, especially weaker foes."
msgstr "处决: 可能瞬间杀死命中的目标，对较弱敌人尤其有效。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "spectral,"
msgstr "幽灵,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Spectral:  When it strikes, its spirit leaps out and fights alongside the wielder."
msgstr "幽灵: 命中时，武器之灵会跃出，与持有者并肩作战。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Zealotry,"
msgstr "狂热,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Zealotry:  Whenever the wielder enters a berserk rage, their allies are berserked alongside them."
msgstr "狂热: 持有者进入狂暴时，其盟友也会一同狂暴。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "damnation"
msgstr "天谴"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Damnation: Any ammunition fired from it explodes in a burst of damnation on striking a foe, dealing damage which bypasses armour."
msgstr "天谴: 射出的弹药命中敌人时，会爆发天谴，造成无视护甲的伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "decimate"
msgstr "摧残"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Decimate: It inflicts additional damage proportional to its victim's maximum health."
msgstr "摧残: 按受害者生命上限的一定比例造成额外伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Halo"
msgstr "光环"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Halo:      It grants its wielder a halo, revealing invisible creatures and increasing accuracy against all within it other than the wielder."
msgstr "光环: 为持有者赋予光环，揭示隐形生物，并提高对范围内其他所有生物的命中率。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Hex"
msgstr "妖术"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "ele,"
msgstr "元素,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Ele:       It enhances your fire, ice, earth and air magic. If skilled in Evocations, you can discharge powerful blasts of elemental energy when striking with it."
msgstr "元素: 增强你的火系、冰系、土系与气系魔法。若擅长唤发，还能在近战命中时释放强大的元素能量。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Acc+∞"
msgstr "命中+∞"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Acc+∞:     It never misses its target."
msgstr "命中+∞: 永远不会射失目标。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "stab,"
msgstr "背刺,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "slay drac,"
msgstr "屠龙,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Slay Drac: It inflicts extra damage against dragons and draconians."
msgstr "屠龙: 对龙与龙人造成额外伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Stab:      It is more effective when stabbing unaware enemies, sometimes treating them as though they were completely helpless."
msgstr "背刺: 对毫无察觉的敌人发动背刺时更有效，有时会将其视为完全无力反抗。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "mutate,"
msgstr "致变,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Mutate:    It occasionally inflicts wild transmutation effects on those it strikes, inflicting malmutation or extra damage, or polymorphing them into a new form."
msgstr "致变: 命中时，偶尔会对目标施加狂野的变形效果，造成恶性变异、额外伤害，或将其变为另一种形态。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "deathbane,"
msgstr "亡灵克星,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Deathbane: It inflicts significantly more damage against the undead."
msgstr "亡灵克星: 对亡灵造成显著增加的伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "curare,"
msgstr "箭毒,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Curare:    It occasionally inflicts asphyxiating poison on those it strikes, dealing poison damage and causing slowness."
msgstr "箭毒: 偶尔使命中目标受到窒息性毒素侵袭，造成毒素伤害和迟缓。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "disarm"
msgstr "缴械"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Disarm:    It may disarm weapon-wielding foes when striking them, dealing extra damage in the process."
msgstr "缴械: 命中持有武器的敌人时，可能将其缴械，并在此过程中造成额外伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "penet"
msgstr "穿透"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Penet:     Any ammunition fired by it passes through the targets it hits, potentially hitting all targets in its path until it reaches maximum range."
msgstr "穿透: 射出的弹药会穿过命中的目标，可能沿途命中所有目标，直到达到最远射程。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "静谧"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Quiet:      All noise in your surroundings is dampened."
msgstr "静谧: 减弱你周围的所有噪音。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Bear,"
msgstr "熊灵,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Bear:      Going berserk makes the wearer exceptionally tough, and they are slowed for a shorter time afterward."
msgstr "熊灵: 狂暴时使穿戴者格外坚韧，且随后迟缓的持续时间更短。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Detect Stab+"
msgstr "探知 背刺+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Detect:    It allows the wearer to sense nearby creatures.\nStab+:     It allows the wearer to make particularly effective stabbing attacks against helpless or unaware enemies with any melee weapon."
msgstr "探知: 允许穿戴者感知附近生物。\n背刺+: 允许穿戴者使用任何近战武器，对无力反抗或毫无察觉的敌人发动格外有效的背刺。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Englaciate"
msgstr "*冰封"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Englaciate: It radiates cold, occasionally slowing all nearby creatures who are not resistant to cold."
msgstr "*冰封: 散发寒气，偶尔使附近所有不具寒冷抗性的生物迟缓。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Flames, rFlCloud"
msgstr "烈焰, 抗火云"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Flames:    It surrounds you with flame clouds.\nrFlCloud:  It grants immunity to flame clouds."
msgstr "烈焰: 以火焰云雾环绕你。\n抗火云: 使你免疫火焰云雾。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Brill Will-∞"
msgstr "辉煌 意志-∞"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Brill:     It increases the power of your magical spells and halves their MP cost (rounding up).\nWill-∞:    It reduces your willpower to zero."
msgstr "辉煌: 提高法术强度，并使魔力消耗减半（向上取整）。\n意志-∞: 使你的意志降至零。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Dragonpray"
msgstr "祈龙"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Dragonpray: It occasionally summons a dragon when using Invocations with hostile monsters in sight. Chance is 10% + twice the piety cost of the ability used."
msgstr "祈龙: 视野内有敌对怪物时，使用祈祷能力偶尔会召唤一条龙。几率为 10% 加上所用能力虔诚消耗的两倍。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "黑暗"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Dark:      It shrouds the wearer in darkness, reducing the range at which they can see and be seen by others."
msgstr "黑暗: 以黑暗笼罩穿戴者，缩小其视野及被其他生物看见的距离。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Riposte"
msgstr "还击"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Riposte:   It allows the wearer to riposte with melee weapons, swiftly retaliating against missed or blocked melee attacks."
msgstr "还击: 允许穿戴者使用近战武器还击，在敌人的近战攻击落空或被抵挡后迅速反击。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Dazzle"
msgstr "*炫目"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Dazzle:   It may blind adjacent enemies who miss an attack against the wearer in melee combat."
msgstr "*炫目: 相邻敌人的近战攻击落空时，可能使其失明。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Rats"
msgstr "*鼠群"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Rats:     When the wearer is hurt, rats may emerge from it to assist them."
msgstr "*鼠群: 穿戴者受伤时，可能有老鼠从中钻出提供援助。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Loud"
msgstr "喧闹"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Loud:      It is deafeningly noisy when blocking attacks."
msgstr "喧闹: 抵挡攻击时，会发出震耳欲聋的噪声。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Inacc"
msgstr "失准"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Inacc:     It reduces the accuracy of your attacks and spells."
msgstr "失准: 降低你攻击和法术的命中率。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Fury"
msgstr "狂怒"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Fury:      It extends the wearer's berserk rage when killing foes."
msgstr "狂怒: 杀死敌人时，会延长穿戴者的狂暴时间。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Thunder rCloud"
msgstr "*雷云 抗云雾"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Thunder:  It occasionally creates storm clouds above nearby enemies.\nrCloud:    It grants its wearer immunity to clouds."
msgstr "*雷云: 偶尔在附近敌人上方制造风暴云。\n抗云雾: 使穿戴者免疫云雾。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "demonic, Mesm"
msgstr "恶魔, 魅惑"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Demonic:   It occasionally summons demons to assist the wielder when it strikes in combat."
msgstr "恶魔: 近战命中时，偶尔召唤恶魔协助持有者。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Mesm:      Its wielder is mesmerised by any visible foes, and it cannot be unequipped while any foes are visible."
msgstr "魅惑: 任何可见的敌人都会使持有者着迷；只要视野内仍有敌人，就无法卸下它。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "swift,"
msgstr "迅捷,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Swift:     It allows the wearer to cover ground more swiftly."
msgstr "迅捷: 使穿戴者能更快地移动。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "manifold assault"
msgstr "多重突袭"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Manifold Assault: It sometimes launches melee attacks against multiple visible enemies."
msgstr "多重突袭: 有时对多个可见敌人发动近战攻击。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "shatter"
msgstr "震碎"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Shatter:   It releases a powerful concussive burst when it strikes, dealing extra damage to the target and all other creatures adjacent to them."
msgstr "震碎: 命中时释放强大的震荡冲击，对目标及其相邻的所有其他生物造成额外伤害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "神盾"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Avatar's Aegis: It grants the wearer a chance to resist fire, cold, poison, electricity, acid, and negative energy."
msgstr "化身神盾: 使穿戴者有机会抵御火焰、寒冷、毒素、电击、酸蚀及负能量。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Ring+"
msgstr "戒指+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Ring+:   It enables you to equip an extra ring."
msgstr "戒指+: 允许额外装备一枚戒指。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Wiz-"
msgstr "法术易施-"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "discharge,"
msgstr "放电,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Discharge: It occasionally unleashes powerful arcs of lightning upon striking a foe. These may arc to other adjacent creatures (including the wielder, but dealing reduced damage to them) before grounding out."
msgstr "放电: 命中敌人时，偶尔释放强大的闪电电弧；电弧可能传导至其他相邻生物（包括持有者，但对其造成的伤害较低），之后才导入地面。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "disrupt,"
msgstr "扰魔,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Disrupt:   It unleashes wild and unpredictable magical effects upon striking a wizard or a creature with magical abilities."
msgstr "扰魔: 命中法师或具有魔法能力的生物时，释放狂野而难以预测的魔法效果。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "silver,"
msgstr "白银,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Silver:    It inflicts extra damage upon those it strikes, and deals substantially increased damage to chaotic, mutated and magically transformed beings."
msgstr "白银: 对命中目标造成额外伤害，对混沌、变异或魔法变形的生物造成的伤害大幅增加。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "immolate, rFlCloud"
msgstr "内焰, 抗火云"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Immolate:  It fills those it strikes with an explosive inner flame."
msgstr "心火: 使命中目标的体内燃起爆炸性的心火。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "rFlCloud:  It grants immunity to clouds of flame."
msgstr "抗火云: 使你免疫火焰云雾。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "spellvamp,"
msgstr "法术吸血,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Spellvamp: It heals its wielder for a portion of the damage dealt when they wound a living foe with it or with a spell, but its wielder's spells cost health as well as magical power."
msgstr "法术吸血: 用它或法术伤害活物时，会按造成伤害的一部分治疗持有者；但持有者施法时除了魔力，还要消耗生命。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "RegenMP+"
msgstr "魔力再生+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "rTorment HP--"
msgstr "抗折磨 生命--"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "NoPotionHeal"
msgstr "药水不疗伤"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "NoPotionHeal: Its wearer cannot be healed by potions."
msgstr "药水不疗伤: 穿戴者无法通过药水获得治疗。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "PotionHeal*2"
msgstr "药水治疗×2"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "PotionHeal*2: Potions heal its wearer twice as much."
msgstr "药水治疗×2: 药水对穿戴者的治疗量加倍。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "freezing cloud,"
msgstr "冰冻云雾,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Freezing Cloud: It occasionally leaves clouds of freezing vapour upon striking a foe, and grants immunity to clouds of freezing vapour."
msgstr "冰冻云雾: 命中敌人时，偶尔留下冰冻云雾，并使持有者免疫冰冻云雾。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "omnireflect"
msgstr "全能反射"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Omnireflect: It can block and reflect piercing ranged attacks and magical attacks against the wielder's willpower."
msgstr "全能反射: 可以抵挡并反射穿透性远程攻击，以及针对持有者意志的魔法攻击。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "freeze, rev,"
msgstr "冻结, 加速,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Freeze:    It freezes victims, dealing an additional one-quarter of any damage that pierces defenders' armour. It may also slow down cold-blooded creatures.\nRev:       It becomes more effective when it hits something. This effect fades over time."
msgstr "冻结: 冻伤目标，额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之一，还可能使冷血生物迟缓。\n加速: 命中目标时会变得更有效；此效果随时间消退。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "reach+"
msgstr "延伸+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Reach+:    It can reach especially far, and its reaching attacks ignore other creatures in the way."
msgstr "延伸+: 攻击距离格外远，且延伸攻击会忽略挡路的其他生物。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Battle: It summons a battlesphere in combat, with strength depending on Conjurations skill.\nDestructive: It enhances your destructive magic, and weakens non-destructive magic."
msgstr "战斗: 在战斗中召唤作战球，强度取决于塑能系魔法技能。\n毁灭: 增强你的毁灭性魔法，削弱非毁灭性魔法。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Corpsefed rMiasma"
msgstr "食尸 抗瘴气"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Corpsefed: It gathers nearby corpses to temporarily increase the armour it provides.\nrMiasma:   It protects you from foul pestilence."
msgstr "食尸: 收集附近的尸体，暂时提高其提供的护甲值。\n抗瘴气: 保护你免受污秽瘟疫侵害。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Rampage+∞"
msgstr "冲锋+∞"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Rampage+∞: When moving toward enemies, its wearer moves as far as possible, alerting their target en route."
msgstr "冲锋+∞: 向敌人移动时，穿戴者会尽可能接近目标，并在途中惊动目标。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Infuse+∞ VampMP"
msgstr "灌注+∞ 汲取魔力"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Infuse+∞:  It empowers its wearer's blows with all of their magic.\nVampMP:    Blows struck in melee replenish the wearer's magic."
msgstr "灌注+∞: 用持有者的全部魔力强化其攻击。\n汲取魔力: 近战命中时补充持有者的魔力。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Dream"
msgstr "*梦境"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Dream:    It absorbs a single lethal wound into itself, holding its wearer just short of death and releasing dream-creatures to guard them."
msgstr "*梦境: 吸收一次致命创伤，使穿戴者停留在死亡边缘，并释放梦境生物守护穿戴者。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "ID++"
msgstr "鉴定++"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "ID++:      It heals its wearer when they drink unknown potions, and restores their MP when they read unknown scrolls."
msgstr "鉴定++: 穿戴者饮用未知药水时恢复生命，阅读未知卷轴时恢复魔力。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "coup de grace"
msgstr "致命一击"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Coup de Grace: It may instantly kill foes which have little health."
msgstr "致命一击: 可能瞬间杀死生命值较低的敌人。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "meekguard"
msgstr "护弱"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Meekguard: It provides extra protection to wielders with little health."
msgstr "护弱: 为生命值较低的持有者提供额外保护。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "anguish,"
msgstr "痛楚,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Anguish:   It makes its victims' attacks reflect back on them."
msgstr "痛楚: 使受害者的攻击反射回自身。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "steadfast,"
msgstr "稳固,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Steadfast: It prevents involuntary movement, except for blinking, teleportation, or banishment."
msgstr "稳固: 阻止非自愿移动，但闪现、传送和放逐除外。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "reach-cleave, Poleaxe"
msgstr "延伸横扫, 长柄斧"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Reach-Cleave: It can be evoked to extend its reach, and strikes at all foes within reach, dealing less damage to those not targeted."
msgstr "延伸横扫: 可发动以延长攻击距离，并攻击范围内的所有敌人；对非主目标造成的伤害较低。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Poleaxe:   It uses either Axes or Polearms skill, whichever is higher."
msgstr "长柄斧: 使用斧或长柄武器技能中较高的一项。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Invo=14 Evo=0"
msgstr "祈祷=14 唤发=0"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Invo=14:   It sets your Invocations skill to 14.\nEvo=0:    It sets your Evocations skill to 0."
msgstr "祈祷=14: 将你的祈祷技能设为 14。\n唤发=0: 将你的唤发技能设为 0。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "slick, slippery,"
msgstr "滑溜, 滑移,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Slick:     Its wearer cannot be constricted, netted, webbed, or stopped by binding sigils.\nSlippery:  Its wearer slips away from damaging melee attacks, pulling the attacker onward."
msgstr "滑溜: 穿戴者不会受到绞缠、投掷网、蛛网或束缚印记的限制。\n滑移: 穿戴者会避开造成伤害的近战攻击，并牵引攻击者向前。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "knockback,"
msgstr "击退,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Knockback: It sometimes drives back enemies it hits."
msgstr "击退: 有时击退命中的敌人。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Valiant"
msgstr "英勇"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Valiant:   It becomes more powerful as more dangerous foes come into view."
msgstr "英勇: 视野中出现的敌人越危险，它就越强大。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Victory"
msgstr "*胜利"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "*Victory:  When the wearer kills a threatening monster, it has a chance to gain +1 AC, +1 Slay, and +1 Int, capping at +7. When the wearer uses a scroll or a potion with a hostile monster in sight, its bonuses reset to +0. Unequipping it also resets its bonuses to +0."
msgstr "*胜利: 穿戴者杀死有威胁的怪物时，有机会获得 +1 护甲值、+1 杀伤和 +1 智力，最高各为 +7。视野中有敌对怪物时，穿戴者使用卷轴或药水会使加成重置为 +0；卸下它也会使加成重置为 +0。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "shock,"
msgstr "电击,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Shock:     When it blocks an attack, it may electrocute the attacker. This works even against foes who are a short distance away."
msgstr "电击: 抵挡攻击时，可能电击攻击者，即使对方距离稍远也有效。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "backblast,"
msgstr "后坐冲击,"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Backblast: When fired, it often launches its wielder backwards."
msgstr "后坐冲击: 发射时，经常将持有者向后击退。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Gadgeteer Wandboost"
msgstr "巧匠 魔杖强化"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Gadgeteer:   Your evocable items recharge 30% faster and wands have a 30% chance to not spend a charge.\nWandboost:   Your wands are more powerful."
msgstr "巧匠: 可发动道具的充能速度提高 30%，魔杖有 30% 几率不消耗充能。\n魔杖强化: 你的魔杖更强大。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "orb Charlatan"
msgstr "宝珠 骗术"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "It massively reduces your stealth.\nIt interferes with translocations, delaying teleports.\nCharlatan: It boosts your other skills by 20% of your base Evocations skill."
msgstr "大幅降低你的潜行。\n干扰位移魔法，使传送延迟。\n骗术: 按你的基础唤发技能的 20% 提高其他技能。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Inspire Amulet+"
msgstr "鼓舞 护符+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Inspire:   When you summon or create an ally, it gains Regeneration.\nAmulet+:   You can equip an additional amulet."
msgstr "鼓舞: 召唤或创造盟友时，使其获得再生。\n护符+: 允许额外装备一枚护符。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Reaping Hat+"
msgstr "收割 帽子+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Reaping:   When you kill an enemy with your weapon, its spirit may be forced to fight for you.\nHat+:   You can equip an additional hat (on the skull)."
msgstr "收割: 用武器杀死敌人时，其灵魂可能被迫为你作战。\n帽子+: 可在头骨上额外装备一顶帽子。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Shroompunch Gloves+"
msgstr "真菌拳 手套+"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Shroompunch:   The cloak sometimes lashes out at its wearer's enemies, inflicting confusion with its spores.\nGloves+:   Your cloak can equip an additional pair of gloves."
msgstr "真菌拳: 披风有时会猛击穿戴者的敌人，以孢子造成混乱。\n手套+: 可为披风额外装备一副手套。"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Majesty Ring++"
msgstr "威仪 戒指++"

#. Reviewed a-source display field; original identifiers remain canonical.
#: crawl-ref/source/art-data.h
msgctxt "a.art-data"
msgid "Majesty:   You are bathed in light that prevents you from turning invisible. Whenever you enter a new floor, you announce yourself to nearby enemies and refuse to leave the floor again for some time.\nRing++:   You can equip two additional rings."
msgstr "威仪: 光芒笼罩着你，使你无法隐身。每次进入新楼层，你都会向附近敌人宣告自己的到来，并在一段时间内拒绝离开该层。\n戒指++: 允许额外装备两枚戒指。"

