#. Reviewed source-b-01; English identifiers and construction preserved.
#: crawl-ref/source/bane-data.h
msgctxt "b.bane.desc"
msgid "Enemies you encounter may be immune to damage from range."
msgstr "你遇到的敌人可能免疫远距离造成的伤害。"

#. Reviewed source-b-01; English identifiers and construction preserved.
#: crawl-ref/source/bane-data.h
msgctxt "b.bane.desc"
msgid "When enemies are summoned, they will appear beside you instead."
msgstr "敌人被召唤时，会改为出现在你身旁。"

