msgid "You smell decay."
msgstr "你闻到了腐朽的气息。"

msgctxt "d.curse"
msgid "Your bandages flutter."
msgstr "你的绷带飘动起来。"

msgctxt "d.curse"
msgid "You hear strange and distant voices."
msgstr "你听到远处传来奇怪的声音。"

msgctxt "d.curse"
msgid "Your bones ache."
msgstr "你的骨头隐隐作痛。"

