msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid "an ominous eye at the end of a thin stalk"
msgstr "细长的柄末端长着一只不祥的眼睛"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid "a face from nightmares"
msgstr "长着噩梦般的面孔"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It seethes with hatred of the living."
msgstr "它对活物满怀憎恨。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Tiny orange flames dance around it."
msgstr "橙色的小火苗在它周围跳动。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Tiny purple flames dance around it."
msgstr "紫色的小火苗在它周围跳动。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is surrounded by a weird haze."
msgstr "奇异的薄雾笼罩着它。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It glows with a malevolent light."
msgstr "它散发着恶毒的光芒。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It looks incredibly angry."
msgstr "它看起来愤怒至极。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It oozes with slime."
msgstr "黏液从它身上不断渗出。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It dribbles constantly."
msgstr "它不停地流口水。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Mould grows all over it."
msgstr "它全身长满霉菌。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its body is covered in fungus."
msgstr "它的身体覆盖着真菌。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is covered with lank hair."
msgstr "它身上披着稀疏凌乱的长毛。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It looks diseased."
msgstr "它看起来病恹恹的。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It looks as frightened of you as you are of it."
msgstr "它似乎和你害怕它一样害怕你。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It moves in a series of hideous convulsions."
msgstr "它在一阵阵可怖的抽搐中移动。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It moves with an unearthly grace."
msgstr "它的动作优雅得不似凡间生物。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It leaves a glistening oily trail."
msgstr "它身后留下一道油亮的痕迹。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It shimmers before your eyes."
msgstr "它在你眼前闪烁。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is surrounded by a brilliant glow."
msgstr "灿烂的光芒笼罩着它。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It radiates an aura of extreme power."
msgstr "它散发出极其强大的气场。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It seems utterly heartbroken."
msgstr "它似乎伤心欲绝。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It seems filled with irrepressible glee."
msgstr "它似乎满怀无法抑制的喜悦。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It constantly shivers and twitches."
msgstr "它不停地颤抖和抽动。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Blue sparks crawl across its body."
msgstr "蓝色火花在它身上游走。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It seems uncertain."
msgstr "它似乎拿不定主意。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " A cloud of flies swarms around it."
msgstr "一群苍蝇围着它飞舞。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " The air around it ripples with heat."
msgstr "它周围的空气因高温而扭曲。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Crystalline structures grow on everything near it."
msgstr "附近的一切都长出了晶体。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It appears supremely confident."
msgstr "它显得自信至极。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its skin is covered in a network of cracks."
msgstr "它的皮肤布满纵横交错的裂纹。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its skin has a disgusting oily sheen."
msgstr "它的皮肤泛着令人作呕的油光。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It seems somehow familiar."
msgstr "它似乎有些眼熟。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is somehow always in shadow."
msgstr "它不知为何总藏在阴影中。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is difficult to look away."
msgstr "你很难将视线从它身上移开。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is constantly speaking in tongues."
msgstr "它不停地说着晦涩难懂的语言。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It babbles unendingly."
msgstr "它喋喋不休地胡言乱语。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its body is scourged by damnation."
msgstr "天谴不断鞭挞着它的身体。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its body is extensively scarred."
msgstr "它身上伤痕累累。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " You find it difficult to look away."
msgstr "你发现自己难以将视线从它身上移开。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Oddly mechanical noises accompany its jarring movements."
msgstr "它突兀的动作伴随着古怪的机械声。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " Its skin looks unnervingly wrinkled."
msgstr "它的皮肤皱得令人不安。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It smells of brimstone."
msgstr "它散发着硫磺味。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It is surrounded by a sickening stench."
msgstr "它周围弥漫着令人作呕的恶臭。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It smells of rotting flesh."
msgstr "它散发着腐肉味。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It stinks of death."
msgstr "它散发着死亡的恶臭。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It stinks of decay."
msgstr "它散发着腐朽的恶臭。"

msgctxt "d.demon.part"
msgid " It smells delicious!"
msgstr "它闻起来很美味！"

