msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You sometimes web enemies you hit."
msgstr "你击中敌人时有时会用蛛网缠住他们。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can move swiftly towards enemies."
msgstr "你能迅速移向敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can leap distances in the blink of an eye."
msgstr "你能在眨眼间跃过一段距离。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are stealthy and inflict bonus damage to unaware enemies."
msgstr "你善于潜行，对未察觉你的敌人造成额外伤害。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are tiny and dextrous."
msgstr "你体型微小，动作灵巧。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are susceptible to poisons. (rPois-)"
msgstr "你容易受到毒素伤害。（毒抗-）"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can perform multiple auxiliary attacks with your blades."
msgstr "你能用刀刃进行多次辅助攻击。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You gain SH while attacking, based on your slaying."
msgstr "你在攻击时根据杀戮加成获得格挡值。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks are powerful."
