msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You have a powerful clawing attack."
msgstr "你拥有强力的爪击。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your giant scaled body is strong and resilient, but less evasive."
msgstr "你巨大的鳞片身躯强壮坚韧，但不够灵活。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks drain, slow and weaken victims."
msgstr "你的近战攻击会吸能、减速并削弱受害者。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can torment nearby foes to heal from their wounds."
msgstr "你能折磨附近的敌人，从他们的创伤中获得治疗。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are immune to unholy pain and torment."
msgstr "你免疫邪恶的痛苦和折磨。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cannot drink."
msgstr "你不能饮用药水。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You recover more slowly from Doom and Banes."
msgstr "你从厄运和灾厄中恢复得更慢。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cover ground extremely quickly."
msgstr "你的移动速度极快。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are tiny, dextrous, and very evasive."
msgstr "你体型微小，动作灵巧，很难被击中。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your unarmed attacks are very weak."
msgstr "你的徒手攻击很弱。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cover ground very quickly."
msgstr "你的移动速度很快。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your bark is very hard, but your evasion is minimal."
msgstr "你的树皮十分坚硬，但你几乎无法闪避。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your unarmed attacks smack enemies forcefully with your branches."
msgstr "你的徒手攻击会用树枝猛烈抽打敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are immune to unholy torment."
msgstr "你免疫邪恶的折磨。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your roots penetrate the ground, keeping you stationary."
msgstr "你的根须深入地面，使你无法移动。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cannot be teleported."
msgstr "你无法被传送。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are tiny and evasive."
msgstr "你体型微小，善于闪避。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are insubstantial and cannot be petrified, ensnared, or set on fire."
msgstr "你的身躯虚无缥缈，无法被石化、缠困或点燃。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are highly resistant to most damage types. (rF++, rC++, rN+++, rElec, rCorr)"
msgstr "你对大多数类型的伤害都有很高的抗性。（火抗++、冰抗++、负能量抗性+++、电抗、腐蚀抗性）"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are resistant to acid and immune to corrosive walls."
msgstr "你能抵抗酸液，且免受腐蚀墙壁的影响。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your amorphous body is immune to blinding, drowning, and ensnarement."
msgstr "你无定形的身体免疫致盲、溺水和缠困。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks splash acid on your foes."
msgstr "你的近战攻击会向敌人泼洒酸液。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cast all spells with heavily decreased power."
msgstr "你的所有法术威力都大幅降低。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks release spores that confuse breathing creatures."
msgstr "你的近战攻击释放的孢子会使需要呼吸的生物混乱。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You become terrified and freeze when enemies are visible."
msgstr "有敌人在视野内时，你会因恐惧而僵住。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Damage taken is halved, but you are drained when taking damage."
msgstr "你受到的伤害减半，但受伤时会受到吸能。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You bleed smoke when taking damage."
msgstr "你受伤时会冒出烟雾。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are invisible."
msgstr "你处于隐形状态。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your willpower is unshakeable."
msgstr "你的意志无法动摇。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your attacks do half damage."
msgstr "你的攻击伤害减半。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your spells are much less powerful."
msgstr "你的法术威力大幅降低。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You swim very quickly."
msgstr "你的游泳速度很快。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can devour living enemies to heal."
msgstr "你能吞噬活着的敌人来治疗自身。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your electrical attacks strike out in all directions at once."
msgstr "你的电击会同时攻击各个方向。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are incredibly evasive."
msgstr "你极其善于闪避。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can turn into living lightning."
msgstr "你能化作活闪电。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your quills sometimes injure those who attack you in melee."
msgstr "你的棘刺有时会刺伤近战攻击你的敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your maw can bite with vicious strength."
msgstr "你的巨口能够凶猛地撕咬。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can devour enemies to increase your regeneration."
msgstr "你能吞噬敌人来提高再生速度。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your maw sometimes becomes mesmerised by tasty morsels."
msgstr "你的巨口有时会被美味的食物迷住。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your maw has eaten a hole through body armour, reducing its AC."
msgstr "你的巨口咬穿了躯干防具，使其护甲值降低。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Foes you strike become dangerously contaminated with transmutational energy."
msgstr "被你击中的敌人会受到危险的变形能量污染。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You glow with energy, making you easy to see."
msgstr "你散发能量光芒，很容易被发现。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your attacks are very weak."
msgstr "你的攻击很弱。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Damage taken is decreased by 1/3."
msgstr "你受到的伤害减少三分之一。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Healing from kills is doubled."
msgstr "你通过击杀获得的治疗翻倍。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You will endure the Crucible once your slaughter is complete."
msgstr "屠戮结束后，你将承受血肉熔炉的考验。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your fangs allow you to drain the lifeblood from your enemies."
msgstr "你的尖牙使你能够吸取敌人的生命之血。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When you kill a living creature with a stab, you may create a vampiric thrall."
msgstr "你刺杀活物时，有机会创造吸血奴仆。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can occasionally transform into a swarm of bats."
msgstr "你偶尔能够变成蝙蝠群。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You often daze monsters when they first notice you."
msgstr "怪物刚察觉到你时，经常会被你震慑。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You are very stealthy."
msgstr "你非常善于潜行。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You do not regenerate when monsters are visible."
msgstr "有怪物在视野内时，你无法再生。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You freeze nearby walls in an area that expands as you fight."
msgstr "你会冻结附近的墙壁，战斗时范围逐渐扩大。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can cast Ice magic more easily."
msgstr "你能更容易地施放冰系魔法。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When at low health, angry bees swarm out to defend you."
msgstr "生命值较低时，愤怒的蜜蜂会蜂拥而出保护你。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You regenerate HP and MP more quickly."
msgstr "你的生命值和魔法值恢复得更快。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your aqueous body allows to you attack from a distance."
msgstr "你的水体使你能够从远处攻击。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When injured, pools of shallow water form around you."
msgstr "受伤时，你周围会形成浅水池。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can command nearby water to drown your enemies."
msgstr "你能驱使附近的水淹没敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When hit by fire damage, your body sometimes produces steam."
msgstr "受到火焰伤害时，你的身体有时会产生蒸汽。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When hit by cold damage, your body sometimes freezes."
msgstr "受到寒冷伤害时，你的身体有时会冻结。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You unleash cutting winds upon enemies you strike."
msgstr "你会向击中的敌人释放割裂之风。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Hexes are much easier for you to cast and harder to resist."
msgstr "你更容易施放妖术系魔法，敌人也更难抵抗它们。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You often pose riddles to enemies when you first see then."
msgstr "初次看到敌人时，你经常会向他们出谜语。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You gain temporary slaying when you kill enemies in melee."
msgstr "你在近战中击杀敌人时，会获得临时杀戮加成。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You sometimes unleash a terrifying howl when you kill enemies in melee."
msgstr "你在近战中击杀敌人时，有时会发出恐怖的嚎叫。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can leap to fearful enemies and eviscerate them."
msgstr "你能跃向恐惧中的敌人，将其开膛破肚。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You have increased skill with all magical schools."
msgstr "你所有魔法学派的技能都得到提高。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks sometimes restore your MP."
msgstr "你的近战攻击有时会恢复魔法值。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cannot cast spells above level 4."
msgstr "你无法施放高于4级的法术。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks are very weak."
msgstr "你的近战攻击很弱。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your body armour is fused into your shell, improving its AC and properties."
msgstr "你的躯干防具与甲壳融合，提高其护甲值及属性。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can exhale clouds of rust."
msgstr "你能呼出锈尘云。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You cover ground slowly."
msgstr "你的移动速度缓慢。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You manifest a globe of solar heat that you carry with you."
msgstr "你会显现出一颗随你移动的太阳热球。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your solar ember damages enemies next to it every second time you attack."
msgstr "你每攻击两次，太阳余烬就会伤害其身边的敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You heal your solar ember whenever you swap places with it."
msgstr "你与太阳余烬交换位置时会治疗它。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks sometimes make enemies vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "你的近战攻击有时会使敌人变得易受火焰伤害。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "You can cast Fire magic much more easily."
msgstr "你能更容易地施放火系魔法。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your tendrils poison nearby enemies when you attack."
msgstr "你攻击时，触须会使附近的敌人中毒。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When significantly injured, you may petrify poisoned enemies."
msgstr "受到重创时，你可能会石化中毒的敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Electricity sometimes discharges through enemies you attack."
msgstr "你攻击敌人时，有时会释放穿过敌人的电流。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "When badly injured, your eels discharge electricity violently."
msgstr "受到重创时，你的电鳗会猛烈放电。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks may weaken breathing enemies."
msgstr "你的近战攻击可能会削弱需要呼吸的敌人。"

msgctxt "f.form.trait"
msgid "Your melee attacks cause explosive burstshrooms to grow."
msgstr "你的近战攻击会使能够爆炸的爆裂蘑菇生长。"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Breath Dmg"
msgstr "吐息伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Blinkbolt Dmg"
msgstr "闪现雷击伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Quill Dmg"
msgstr "棘刺伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Contam Dmg"
msgstr "污染伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Frigid Wall Dmg"
msgstr "冰墙伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Watery Grave Dmg"
msgstr "水葬伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Flare Dmg"
msgstr "耀斑伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Jolt damage"
msgstr "电击伤害"

msgctxt "f.form.label"
msgid "Burstshroom damage"
msgstr "爆裂蘑菇伤害"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "Your %s are electric eels."
msgstr "你的%s变成了电鳗。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "Your %s were electric eels."
msgstr "你的%s曾变成电鳗。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "Your %s is a mass of colorful fungus."
msgstr "你的%s变成了一团彩色真菌。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "Your %s was a mass of colorful fungus."
msgstr "你的%s曾变成一团彩色真菌。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.name"
msgid "vessel of slaughter (+%s%% damage done)"
msgstr "屠戮化身（造成的伤害+%s%%）"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.message"
msgid "%s bursts from %s!"
msgstr "%s从%s体内破体而出！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.expiring"
msgid "%s (expiring)"
msgstr "%s（即将结束）"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.expiring"
msgid "Expiring: %s"
msgstr "即将结束：%s"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "You are a fearsome %s!"
msgstr "你现在是可怕的%s！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "f.form.description"
msgid "You were a fearsome %s!"
msgstr "你曾是可怕的%s！"

msgctxt "log.monster"
msgid " shudders and is absorbed by its neighbour."
msgstr "颤抖着被同伴吸收了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "(Slaughtering mortal victims (and sometimes even demons) will eventually satisfy Makhleb and create an exit.)"
msgstr "（屠杀凡物，有时也包括恶魔，最终会使马科列布满意并创造出口。）"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You offer yourself as an instrument of Makhleb's will and feel overwhelming power flowing through you!"
msgstr "你献身成为马科列布意志的工具，感到压倒性的力量涌遍全身！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You carve a gateway into yourself and beckon forth the legions of chaos!"
msgstr "你在自己身上刻出一道门，召来混沌军团！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You are already unleashing the legions of chaos!"
msgstr "你已经在释放混沌军团！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your destruction surges wildly!"
msgstr "你的毁灭之力狂野地涌动！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your accumulated destruction dissipates without a target."
msgstr "你积蓄的毁灭之力因没有目标而消散。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Slime begins to ooze from the nearby walls!"
msgstr "黏液开始从附近的墙壁中渗出！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There are no walls around you to affect."
msgstr "你周围没有可影响的墙壁。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel like a meek peon again."
msgstr "你又觉得自己像个卑微的苦工。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel invigorated by the roar of the crowd!"
msgstr "观众的欢呼声使你精神振奋！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You cannot duel that!"
msgstr "你无法与那个目标决斗！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can see no monster there to duel!"
msgstr "你看不到那里有可决斗的怪物！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The air is filled with shimmering golden clouds!"
msgstr "空气中布满了闪烁的金色云雾！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Aiming: <white>Wall Jump</white>"
msgstr "瞄准：<white>蹬墙跳</white>"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You are too terrified to wall jump!"
msgstr "你太恐惧了，无法蹬墙跳跃！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There is nothing to wall jump against here."
msgstr "这里没有可借力蹬跳的墙壁。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't transfer that."
msgstr "你无法转移那个目标。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't see anything there. Try transferring anyway?"
msgstr "你看不到那里有任何东西。仍要尝试换位吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Select a target."
msgstr "选择一个目标。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You have no ancestor to preserve!"
msgstr "你没有可守护的先祖！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "It is so."
msgstr "就这样吧。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't make this choice while your ancestor is elsewhere."
msgstr "你的先祖不在此处，无法作出这项选择。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You spring back to your original position."
msgstr "你跃回了原来的位置。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't perceive a target there!"
msgstr "你无法察觉到那里的目标！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Aiming: <white>Grand Finale</white>"
msgstr "瞄准：<white>终场绝演</white>"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Something unexpectedly blocks you, preventing you from passing!"
msgstr "有东西意外地挡住了你，使你无法穿行！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't walk through walls!"
msgstr "你无法穿墙！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't line pass into the sea of lava!"
msgstr "你无法穿行到熔岩海里！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't line pass into the sea!"
msgstr "你无法穿行到海里！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't stand on top of the monster!"
msgstr "你无法站到怪物身上！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Aiming: <white>Line Pass</white>"
msgstr "瞄准：<white>穿阵舞步</white>"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You stomp with the beat, sending a shockwave through the revellers around you!"
msgstr "你随节拍跺脚，向周围的狂欢者发出冲击波！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There are friendlies around, are you sure you want to hurt them?"
msgstr "周围有友军，确定要伤害他们吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You reveal the great annihilating truth to your foes!"
msgstr "你向敌人揭示了毁灭一切的伟大真理！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There are no visible enemies. Unleash your apocalypse anyway?"
msgstr "视野内没有敌人。仍要释放启示录吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Something unexpectedly blocks you, preventing you from leaping!"
msgstr "有东西意外地挡住了你，使你无法跳跃！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't leap into the sea of lava!"
msgstr "你无法跳进熔岩海里！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't leap into the sea!"
msgstr "你无法跳进海里！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't leap on top of the monster!"
msgstr "你无法跳到怪物身上！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Aiming: <white>Power Leap</white>"
msgstr "瞄准：<white>强力跃击</white>"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You are too terrified to leap around!"
msgstr "你太恐惧了，无法跳跃！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You burst free from the net!"
msgstr "你挣脱了网！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You burst free from the webs!"
msgstr "你挣脱了蛛网！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You are restored by drawing out deep reserves of power within."
msgstr "你引出了体内深藏的力量，恢复了自身。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Do you really want to reject the sacrifices Ru is offering?"
msgstr "确定要拒绝入提供的献祭机会吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Do you really want to make this sacrifice?"
msgstr "确定要作出这项献祭吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Nature churns violently around you!"
msgstr "大自然在你周围剧烈翻腾！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There are friendlies around; are you sure you want to hurt them?"
msgstr "周围有友军，确定要伤害他们吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There isn't enough space here!"
msgstr "这里没有足够的空间！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Clouds arounds you coalesce and take form!"
msgstr "你周围的云雾凝聚成形！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can't see any clouds you can empower."
msgstr "你看不到可强化的云雾。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Aiming: <white>Upheaval</white>"
msgstr "瞄准：<white>剧变术</white>"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You don't have enough gold to fund that merchant!"
msgstr "你的金币不足以资助那位商人！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Fund which merchant?"
msgstr "资助哪位商人？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You need to be standing on open floor to call a merchant."
msgstr "你必须站在空旷的地面上才能召来商人。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "No merchants are willing to come to this location."
msgstr "没有商人愿意来这里。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You don't have enough gold for that!"
msgstr "你的金币不够！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Purchase which effect?"
msgstr "购买哪种效果？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your performance comes to an abrupt end."
msgstr "你的表演戛然而止。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The world around you is engulfed in lightless night!"
msgstr "你周围的世界被无光的黑夜吞没！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You swap places with your shadow and weave the vestiges of your form into it."
msgstr "你与你的影子交换了位置，并将残留的形体编织进影子中。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your orcish features manifest fully."
msgstr "你的兽人特征完全显现了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your vengeful prayer will end if you leave here. Continue?"
msgstr "离开这里会终止你的复仇祷告。继续吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Beogh appreciates your bravery."
msgstr "比欧弗赞赏你的勇气。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to flee a divine trial? This will place you under penance!"
msgstr "确定要逃离神圣试炼吗？这会使你受到赎罪惩罚！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You reach the end of your prayer and your brethren are recalled."
msgstr "你的祷告结束了，同胞们被召回了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The other orcs roar their approval!"
msgstr "其他兽人咆哮着表示赞同！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The priest grants you succour and welcomes you into the fold."
msgstr "祭司援助了你，并欢迎你加入教众。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You cannot uncurse and destroy that!"
msgstr "你无法解除并摧毁那件物品的诅咒！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Uncurse and destroy which item?"
msgstr "解除并摧毁哪件物品的诅咒？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You cannot curse that!"
msgstr "你无法诅咒那件物品！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You return to the normal time flow."
msgstr "你回到了正常的时间之流。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You step out of the flow of time."
msgstr "你踏出了时间之流。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You warp the flow of time around you!"
msgstr "你扭曲了周围的时间之流！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can feel time thicken for a moment."
msgstr "你感到时间在一瞬间变得粘稠。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "There's no one hasty visible. Invoke Slouch anyway?"
msgstr "视野内没有行动迅速的目标。仍要使用懒行吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The flow of time bends around you."
msgstr "时间之流在你周围弯曲。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The black torch howls with new intensity!"
msgstr "黑色火炬的呼啸愈发强烈！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Yredelemnul sends servants to aid you!"
msgstr "伊莱德莱姆努尔派来仆从援助你！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel less strong-willed."
msgstr "你觉得意志不再那么坚定。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your skin stops crawling."
msgstr "你的皮肤不再发麻。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel strong-willed."
msgstr "你感到意志坚定。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your divine vigour fades away."
msgstr "你的神圣活力消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel purified!"
msgstr "你感到自己得到了净化！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your divine shield fades away."
msgstr "你的神圣护盾消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your divine shield is renewed."
msgstr "你的神圣护盾得到了更新。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "A divine shield manifests in front of you!"
msgstr "一面神圣护盾出现在你面前！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You are suddenly bathed in radiance!"
msgstr "你突然沐浴在光辉之中！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You hear a choir sing!"
msgstr "你听到唱诗班的歌声！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You cannot imprison a law-abiding creature!"
msgstr "你无法囚禁守法的生物！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You cannot imprison that!"
msgstr "你无法囚禁那个目标！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You can see no monster there to imprison!"
msgstr "你看不到那里有可囚禁的怪物！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your divine stamina fades away."
msgstr "你的神圣耐力消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You're not ready to recite again yet."
msgstr "你还不能再次诵经。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Finish your current sermon first, please."
msgstr "请先完成当前的布道。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel that your burden of sins will soon be lighter."
msgstr "你觉得自己的罪孽很快就会减轻。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel that you will soon be absolved of all your sins."
msgstr "你觉得自己很快就会被赦免一切罪过。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Do you wish to donate half of your money?"
msgstr "要捐出一半的钱吗？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You have nothing to donate!"
msgstr "你没有可捐献的金钱！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Brand which weapon?"
msgstr "为哪件武器添加印记？"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your apostles return to your side."
msgstr "你的使徒回到了你身边。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel as though your fallen companions have been avenged."
msgstr "你觉得倒下的同伴已经得到了复仇。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "\"Reflect upon your actions, mortal!\""
msgstr "“反省你的所作所为，凡人！”"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Beogh is disappointed with your cowardice."
msgstr "比欧弗对你的懦弱感到失望。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Beogh sends your followers elsewhere."
msgstr "比欧弗将你的追随者送往了别处。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You have no companions."
msgstr "你没有同伴。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "A whirlwind of blades manifests around you!"
msgstr "一阵刀刃旋风出现在你周围！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The heavenly storm settles."
msgstr "天界风暴平息了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your supernatural speed expires."
msgstr "你的超自然神速结束了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your resistance to physical damage fades away."
msgstr "你对物理伤害的抗性消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your resistance to electricity fades away."
msgstr "你的电抗消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your resistance to cold fades away."
msgstr "你的冰抗消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your resistance to fire fades away."
msgstr "你的火抗消退了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You hear a distant slurping noise."
msgstr "你听到远处传来吮吸声。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "A being of your status worships no god."
msgstr "像你这样的存在不信奉任何神祇。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The divine experience drains your vigour!"
msgstr "神力的冲击吸走了你的活力！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The divine experience confuses you!"
msgstr "神力的冲击使你混乱了！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel overwhelmed by the shadows around you."
msgstr "你觉得周围的暗影压得你喘不过气。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel lethargic."
msgstr "你感到昏昏欲睡。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Plants grow around you in an ominous manner."
msgstr "植物以不祥的姿态在你周围生长。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Fedhas booms out: Become one with the cycle of life!"
msgstr "费德哈轰然宣告：融入生命的轮回吧！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The ground quivers slightly."
msgstr "地面微微颤动。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Some slimes ooze up out of the ground!"
msgstr "一些史莱姆从地底涌了出来！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Mutagenic energy floods into your body!"
msgstr "致变异能量涌入你的身体！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You feel Jiyva alter your body."
msgstr "你感到吉瓦改变了你的身体。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Your doom draws closer."
msgstr "你的厄运逼近了。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha's malice focuses upon you."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈的恶意集中到了你身上。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You hear Kikubaaqudgha cackling."
msgstr "你听到奇库巴库哈的狂笑声。"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "The world leaves you behind!"
msgstr "世界将你抛在了身后！"

msgctxt "g.message"
msgid "You lose track of time!"
msgstr "你失去了对时间的感知！"

