msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "It was the word of Zin that there would not be @sin_noun@..."
msgstr "辛曾宣言：世间不应有@sin_noun@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and did the people not suffer until they had @smitten@..."
msgstr "……人民不是一直受苦，直到他们@smitten@了……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the @sinners@, after which all was well?"
msgstr "……那些@sinners@，才终于得享安宁吗？"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "The voice of Zin, pure and clear, did say that the @sinners@..."
msgstr "辛那纯净清澈的声音宣告：@sinners@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...were not @virtuous@! And hearing this, the people rose up..."
msgstr "……并不@virtuous@！人民听罢便奋起……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and embraced @virtue@, for they feared Zin's wrath."
msgstr "……拥抱@virtue@，因为他们惧怕辛的神怒。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin spoke of the doctrine of @virtue@, and..."
msgstr "辛宣讲@virtue@的教义，并且……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...saw the @sinners@ filled with fear, for they were..."
msgstr "……看到@sinners@满心恐惧，因为他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@sin_adj@ and knew Zin's wrath would come for them."
msgstr "……@sin_adj@，知道辛的神怒终将降临。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "And so Zin bade the @sinners@ to come before..."
msgstr "于是辛命令@sinners@前来……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the altar, that judgement might be passed..."
msgstr "……祭坛之前，让审判降临……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...upon those who were not @virtuous@."
msgstr "……那些不够@virtuous@的人。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "To the devout, Zin provideth. From the rest..."
msgstr "虔诚者，辛予以恩赐。而其余的人……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...ye @sinners@, ye guilty..."
msgstr "……你们这些@sinners@，你们犯下了……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...of @sin_noun@, Zin taketh."
msgstr "……@sin_noun@之罪，辛将予以剥夺。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin saw the @sin_noun@ of the @sinners@, and..."
msgstr "辛看见@sin_noun@的@sinners@，便……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...was displeased, for did the law not say that..."
msgstr "……心生不悦，因为律法不是说过……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...those who did not become @virtuous@ would be @smitten@?"
msgstr "……不愿成为@virtuous@之人，终将被@smitten@吗？"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin said that @virtue@ shall be the law of the land, and..."
msgstr "辛说，@virtue@当为世间律法，并且……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...those who turn to @sin_noun@ will be @smitten@. This was fair..."
msgstr "……转向@sin_noun@之人必被@smitten@。此乃公平……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and just, and not a voice dissented."
msgstr "……正义之举，无人出声反对。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Damned, damned be the @sinners@ and..."
msgstr "诅咒，诅咒那些@sinners@，以及……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...all else who abandon @virtue@! Let them..."
msgstr "……所有背弃@virtue@之人！让他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...be @smitten@ by the jurisprudence of Zin!"
msgstr "……在辛的律法之下被@smitten@！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "And Zin said to all in attendance, 'Which of ye..."
msgstr "辛对在场众人说：“你们之中，谁……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...number among the @sinners@? Come before me, that..."
msgstr "……属于@sinners@？到我面前来，让……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...I may @smite@ you now for your @sin_noun@!'"
msgstr "……我因你们的@smite@，立刻@sin_noun@你们！”"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Yea, I say unto thee, bring forth..."
msgstr "是的，我告诉你们，把他们带来……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the @sinners@ that they may know..."
msgstr "……把@sinners@带来，让他们见识……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the wrath of Zin, and thus be @smitten@!"
msgstr "……辛的神怒，就此被@smitten@！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "In a great set of silver scales are weighed the..."
msgstr "在巨大的银色天平上称量的……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...souls of the @sinners@, and with their @sin_adj@..."
msgstr "……是@sinners@的灵魂，而他们@sin_adj@的……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...ways, the balance hath tipped against them!"
msgstr "……行径，使天平倾向了不利于他们的一端！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "It is just that the @sinners@ shall be @smitten@..."
msgstr "@sinners@终将被@smitten@，此乃公义……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...in due time, for @virtue@ is what Zin has declared..."
msgstr "……时机一到便会如此，因为辛已宣布@virtue@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the law of the land, and Zin's word is law!"
msgstr "……就是世间的律法，而辛之言即为律法！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Thus the people made the covenant of @virtue@ with..."
msgstr "于是人民与辛订立了@virtue@的盟约……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...Zin, and all was good, for they knew that the..."
msgstr "……一切都很好，因为他们知道……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@sinners@ would trouble them no longer."
msgstr "……@sinners@将不再滋扰他们。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "What of the @sinners@? @Smitten@ for their..."
msgstr "@sinners@将如何？他们必将被@Smitten@，因为……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@sin_noun@ they shall be! Zin will @smite@ them again..."
msgstr "……他们犯下了@sin_noun@！辛会再次@smite@他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and again, and again!"
msgstr "……一遍，又一遍！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "And lo, the wrath of Zin did find..."
msgstr "看啊，辛的神怒找到了他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...them wherever they hid, and the @sinners@..."
msgstr "……无论他们躲在哪里，而@sinners@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...were @smitten@ for their @sin_noun@!"
msgstr "……都因@smitten@而被@sin_noun@！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin looked out upon the remains of the @sinners@..."
msgstr "辛俯视着@sinners@的残骸……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and declared it good that they had been..."
msgstr "……宣告他们被如此处置是好事……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@smitten@. And thus justice was done."
msgstr "……他们已被@smitten@。正义由此得以伸张。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "The law of Zin demands thee..."
msgstr "辛的律法要求你们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...be @virtuous@, and that the punishment for @sin_noun@..."
msgstr "……成为@virtuous@之人，而对@sin_noun@的惩罚……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...shall be swift and harsh!"
msgstr "……将迅速而严酷！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "It was then that Zin bade them..."
msgstr "那时，辛告诫他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...not to stray from @virtue@, lest..."
msgstr "……不要偏离@virtue@，否则……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...they become as damned as the @sinners@."
msgstr "……便会如@sinners@一般遭受诅咒。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Only the @virtuous@ shall be judged worthy, and..."
msgstr "只有@virtuous@之人会被判为有德，而……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...all the @sinners@ will be found wanting. Such is..."
msgstr "……所有@sinners@都会被认定有所亏欠。这就是……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the word of Zin, and such is the law!"
msgstr "……辛之言，这就是律法！"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "To those who would swear an oath of @virtue@ on my altar..."
msgstr "愿在我的祭坛前立下@virtue@誓言的人……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...I bring ye salvation. To the rest, ye @sinners@..."
msgstr "……我将赐予救赎。至于其余的人，你们这些@sinners@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and the @sin_adj@, the name of Zin shall be thy damnation."
msgstr "……还有@sin_adj@之人，辛之名将成为你们的劫罚。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "And Zin decreed that the people would be..."
msgstr "辛谕令，人民当……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...protected from @sin_noun@ in all its forms, and..."
msgstr "……免受一切形式的@sin_noun@侵害，并且……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...preserved in their @virtue@ for all the days to come."
msgstr "……永远坚守他们的@virtue@。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "For those who would enter Zin's holy bosom..."
msgstr "愿投入辛神圣怀抱的人……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...and live in @virtue@, Zin provideth. Such is..."
msgstr "……愿恪守@virtue@之人，辛将赐予恩惠。这就是……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...the covenant, and such is the way of things."
msgstr "……盟约，这就是世间的道理。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin hath not damned the @sinners@, but it is they..."
msgstr "辛并未诅咒@sinners@，而是他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...that have damned themselves for their @sin_noun@, for..."
msgstr "……因自己的@sin_noun@诅咒了自己，因为……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...did Zin not decree that to be @sin_adj@ was wrong?"
msgstr "……辛不是早已宣布，@sin_adj@是错误的吗？"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "And Zin, furious at their @sin_noun@, held..."
msgstr "辛因他们的@sin_noun@而愤怒，高高……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...aloft a silver sceptre! The @sinners@..."
msgstr "……举起银色权杖！@sinners@……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...were @smitten@, and thus the way of things was maintained."
msgstr "……被@smitten@，世间的秩序由此维系。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "When the law of the land faltered, Zin rose..."
msgstr "当世间律法动摇之时，辛起身……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...from the silver throne, and the @sinners@ were..."
msgstr "……离开银色王座，@sinners@便……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@smitten@. And it was thus that the law was made good."
msgstr "……被@smitten@。律法由此重获效力。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "Zin descended from on high in a silver chariot..."
msgstr "辛乘着银色战车自高天降临……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...to @smite@ the @sinners@ for their..."
msgstr "……要@smite@那些@sinners@，因为他们……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...@sin_noun@, and thus judgement was rendered."
msgstr "……犯下了@sin_noun@，审判由此降下。"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "The @sinners@ stood before Zin, and in that instant..."
msgstr "@sinners@站在辛面前，就在那一刻……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...they knew they would be found guilty of @sin_noun@..."
msgstr "……他们知道自己将被判犯有@sin_noun@之罪……"

msgctxt "g.recite.verse"
msgid "...for that is the word of Zin, and Zin's word is law."
msgstr "……因为这就是辛之言，而辛之言即为律法。"

