msgstr "你感到痛苦使自己充满了活力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel even more energised by your suffering."
msgstr "你感到痛苦带来了更多活力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel completely energised by your suffering."
msgstr "你感到痛苦使自己活力充沛。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical and physical power is slightly enhanced at high health."
msgstr "你的生命值较高时，魔法和物理威力略有增强。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical and physical power is enhanced at high health."
msgstr "你的生命值较高时，魔法和物理威力有所增强。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical and physical power is greatly enhanced at high health."
msgstr "你的生命值较高时，魔法和物理威力大幅增强。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel power flowing into your body."
msgstr "你感到力量流入体内。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel power rushing into your body."
msgstr "你感到力量涌入体内。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel saturated with power."
msgstr "你感到体内充满了力量。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "When hurt, damage is shared between your health and your magic reserves."
msgstr "受伤时，伤害由你的生命值和魔力储备分担。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your magical essence form a protective shroud around your flesh."
msgstr "你感到魔法本质形成了一层护罩，保护着你的血肉。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regenerate magic rapidly."
msgstr "你的魔力再生很快。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magic begins to regenerate rapidly."
msgstr "你的魔力开始快速再生。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "When low on magic, you restore magic in place of health."
msgstr "魔力不足时，你会恢复魔力而非生命值。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your life force and your magical essence meld."
msgstr "你感到生命力与魔法本质融合了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your rubbery body absorbs attacks. (AC +1, EV +1)"
msgstr "你橡胶般的身体能够吸收攻击。(护甲值+1，闪避值+1)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your pliable body absorbs attacks. (AC +2, EV +2)"
msgstr "你柔软的身体能够吸收攻击。(护甲值+2，闪避值+2)"

