msgstr "你的反应略显迟缓（闪避值 -5）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have slow reflexes. (EV -10)"
msgstr "你的反应迟缓（闪避值 -10）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have very slow reflexes. (EV -15)"
msgstr "你的反应非常迟缓（闪避值 -15）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your reflexes slow."
msgstr "你的反应变慢了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your reflexes slow further."
msgstr "你的反应进一步变慢了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You reflexes return to normal."
msgstr "你的反应恢复了正常。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You reflexes speed back up."
msgstr "你的反应再次加快了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are slightly weak-willed. (Will-)"
msgstr "你的意志略显薄弱（意志-）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are weak-willed. (Will--)"
msgstr "你的意志薄弱（意志--）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are extremely weak-willed. (Will---)"
msgstr "你的意志极其薄弱（意志---）"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel weak-willed."
msgstr "你感到意志薄弱。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel more weak-willed."
msgstr "你感到意志更加薄弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer feel weak-willed."
msgstr "你不再感到意志薄弱。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less weak-willed."
msgstr "你感到意志没那么薄弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your casting is slightly disrupted."
msgstr "你的施法略受干扰"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your casting is disrupted."
msgstr "你的施法受到干扰"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your casting is seriously disrupted."
msgstr "你的施法受到严重干扰"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your ability to control magic is disrupted."
msgstr "你掌控魔法的能力受到了干扰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your ability to control magic is more disrupted."
msgstr "你掌控魔法的能力受到了更强的干扰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your ability to control magic is no longer disrupted."
msgstr "你掌控魔法的能力不再受到干扰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your ability to control magic is less disrupted."
msgstr "你掌控魔法的能力受到的干扰减弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You expend magic power (3 MP) to strengthen your wands."
msgstr "你消耗魔力(3点)来强化魔杖。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your magical essence link to the dungeon's wands."
msgstr "你感到自己的魔法本质与地下城的魔杖联系了起来。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical essence no longer links to wands of the dungeon."
msgstr "你的魔法本质不再与地下城的魔杖相连。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are somewhat unskilled. (-1 Apt)"
msgstr "你的技巧有所欠缺。(天资-1)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are unskilled. (-2 Apt)"
msgstr "你的技巧欠缺。(天资-2)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are extremely unskilled. (-3 Apt)"
msgstr "你的技巧极其欠缺。(天资-3)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less skilled."
msgstr "你感到技巧退步了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regain all your skill."
msgstr "你恢复了所有技能。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regain some skill."
msgstr "你恢复了部分技能。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are somewhat inexperienced. (-1 XL)"
msgstr "你的经验有所欠缺。(经验等级-1)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are inexperienced. (-2 XL)"
msgstr "你的经验欠缺。(经验等级-2)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are extremely inexperienced. (-3 XL)"
msgstr "你的经验极其欠缺。(经验等级-3)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less experienced."
msgstr "你感到自己不那么老练了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regain all your potential."
msgstr "你恢复了全部潜力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regain some potential."
msgstr "你恢复了部分潜力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your paws help you pounce on unaware monsters."
msgstr "你的爪掌有助于扑向毫无察觉的怪物。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are missing an eye, making it more difficult to aim."
msgstr "你缺少一只眼睛，瞄准更加困难。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your right eye vanishes! The world loses its depth."
msgstr "你的右眼消失了！世界失去了纵深。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your right eye suddenly reappears! The world regains its depth."
msgstr "你的右眼突然重现！世界重新有了纵深。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are sensitive to extremes of temperature. (rF-, rC-)"
msgstr "你对极端温度敏感。(火抗-，冰抗-)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel sensitive to extremes of temperature."
msgstr "你感到自己对极端温度敏感。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer feel sensitive to extremes of temperature"
msgstr "你不再对极端温度敏感"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You cannot voluntarily change form."
msgstr "你无法主动改变形态。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can no longer voluntarily change form."
msgstr "你无法再主动改变形态了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can once more change form."
msgstr "你又能改变形态了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You do not regenerate."
msgstr "你无法再生。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You stop regenerating."
msgstr "你的再生停止了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You start regenerating."
msgstr "你的再生开始了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have an uncanny knack for detecting items."
msgstr "你有探测物品的奇特本领。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You suddenly feel aware of treasure."
msgstr "你突然感知到了财宝。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer feel aware of treasure."
msgstr "你不再能感知财宝。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are resistant to acid. (rCorr)"
msgstr "你能抵抗酸液。(腐蚀抗性)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel resistant to acid."
msgstr "你感到自己能够抵抗酸液了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less resistant to acid."
msgstr "你感到抵抗酸液的能力减弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your four strong arms can wield two-handed weapons with a shield."
msgstr "你强壮的四条手臂能让你同时使用双手武器和盾牌。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Two of your arms shrink away."
msgstr "你的两条手臂缩回去了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You grow two extra arms."
msgstr "你长出了两条额外的手臂。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You cannot drink."
msgstr "你不能饮用药水。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your mouth dries to ashes."
msgstr "你的嘴干成了灰烬。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You gain the ability to drink."
msgstr "你获得了饮用的能力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have a special connection with the divine. (Faith)"
msgstr "你与神圣力量有特殊联系。(信仰)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel connected to something greater than you."
msgstr "你感到自己与更伟大的存在相连。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel rebellious."
msgstr "你感到叛逆。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You reflexively headbutt those who attack you in melee."
msgstr "你会反射性地用头撞击近战攻击你的敌人。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your retaliatory reflexes feel sharp."
msgstr "你的反击反应感觉很敏锐。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your retaliatory reflexes feel dull."
msgstr "你的反击反应感觉迟钝了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are immune to the effects of steam."
msgstr "你免疫蒸汽的影响。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are now immune to the effects of steam."
msgstr "你现在免疫蒸汽的影响了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are no longer immune to the effects of steam."
msgstr "你不再免疫蒸汽的影响。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are incapable of wielding weapons or throwing items."
msgstr "你无法持握武器或投掷物品。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can no longer grasp objects."
msgstr "你无法再抓握物体了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can now grasp objects."
msgstr "你现在能抓握物体了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You cannot wear armour."
msgstr "你无法穿戴防具。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can no longer wear armour."
msgstr "你无法再穿戴防具了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can now wear armour."
msgstr "你现在能穿戴防具了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You gain extra lives every three experience levels."
msgstr "你每升三级就会获得额外生命。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are no longer multi-lived."
msgstr "你不再拥有多条生命。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can now gain extra lives."
msgstr "你现在能获得额外生命了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your experience applies equally to all skills."
msgstr "你的经验值会平均用于所有技能。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your experience now applies equally to all skills."
msgstr "你的经验值现在会平均用于所有技能。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your experience no longer applies equally to all skills."
msgstr "你的经验值不再平均用于所有技能。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are camouflaged when in or above water. (Stealth+)"
msgstr "你在水中或水上时会得到伪装。(潜行+)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are very nimble when in or above water. (Stealth+, EV+, Speed+++)"
msgstr "你在水中或水上时非常灵活。(潜行+，闪避值+，速度+++)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel comfortable near water."
msgstr "你感到靠近水很舒适。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel very comfortable near water."
msgstr "你感到靠近水非常舒适。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less comfortable near water."
msgstr "你感到靠近水没那么舒适了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have tentacles for arms and can constrict enemies."
msgstr "你的手臂是触手，能够缠绕敌人。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your arms feel tentacular."
msgstr "你的手臂感觉变成了触手。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your arms no longer feel tentacular."
msgstr "你的手臂不再感觉是触手了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your lower body shifts to a powerful aquatic tail in water."
msgstr "在水中，你的下半身会变成强壮的水生尾巴。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your legs feel aquatic."
msgstr "你的双腿感觉适合水中活动。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your legs no longer feel aquatic."
msgstr "你的双腿不再感觉适合水中活动。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You float through the air rather than walking."
msgstr "你不步行，而是飘浮在空中。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel both weightless and legless."
msgstr "你感到自己既没有重量，也没有双腿。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel dragged down by the weight of the world."
msgstr "你感到被世界的重量拖向地面。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You learn spells naturally, not from books."
msgstr "你会自然学会法术，不依靠书籍。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel mystic power welling inside you."
msgstr "你感到神秘的力量在体内涌动。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel a greater respect for book-learning."
msgstr "你感到自己更加尊重书本学习了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical power is your life essence."
msgstr "你的魔力就是你的生命本质。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your magical power and health merge together."
msgstr "你的魔力与生命值融合了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your life and magic unlink."
msgstr "你的生命与魔法不再相连。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have superior vitality. (+4 MHP)"
msgstr "你的生命力更强。(最大生命值+4)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have much superior vitality. (+8 MHP)"
msgstr "你的生命力强大得多。(最大生命值+8)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have exceptionally superior vitality. (+12 MHP)"
msgstr "你的生命力异常强大。(最大生命值+12)"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel more vital."
msgstr "你感到生命力增强了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less vital."
msgstr "你感到生命力减弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your melee attacks may flood your foes with ooze."
msgstr "你的近战攻击可能将黏液灌入敌人体内。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You begin exuding ooze."
msgstr "你开始渗出黏液。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You stop exuding ooze."
msgstr "你停止渗出黏液。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You have an extended range of vision and can be seen from far away."
msgstr "你的视野更广，也更容易被远处发现。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "The darkness flees at your approach."
msgstr "黑暗在你靠近时逃散。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "The shadows grow bolder once more."
msgstr "阴影再次变得大胆起来。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your divine heritage dramatically boosts your attributes as you level up."
msgstr "你的神圣血统使你的属性随等级提升而大幅增长。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel more divine."
msgstr "你感到自己更有神性了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel more mortal."
msgstr "你感到自己更加凡俗了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You thrive by killing the living."
msgstr "你通过杀死活物而茁壮成长。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel hungry for flesh."
msgstr "你感到渴望血肉。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less hungry for flesh."
msgstr "你感到对血肉的渴望减弱了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are easily found by Zot."
msgstr "佐特很容易找到你。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your time running out."
msgstr "你感到自己的时间正在耗尽。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel long-lived."
msgstr "你感到自己长寿了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are faintly shadowed, very rarely releasing foul flame when damaged in melee."
msgstr "你身上有淡淡阴影，近战受伤时极少释放邪焰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are shadowed, sometimes releasing foul flame when damaged in melee."
msgstr "你身上有阴影，近战受伤时有时释放邪焰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You are darkly shadowed, frequently releasing foul flame when damaged in melee."
msgstr "你身上有浓重阴影，近战受伤时经常释放邪焰。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your body darkens with foul flame."
msgstr "你的身体因邪焰而变暗。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your body becomes darker with foul flame."
msgstr "你的身体因邪焰而进一步变暗。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your body's darkness fades completely."
msgstr "你身体的黑暗完全消退了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your body's darkness fades."
msgstr "你身体的黑暗消退了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You regain HP and MP as you explore."
msgstr "你会在探索时恢复生命值和魔力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel a fierce wanderlust."
msgstr "你强烈地渴望远行。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel like a homebody."
msgstr "你觉得自己成了宅家的人。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You gain doubled healing and magic from potions."
msgstr "你从药水获得的治疗和魔力加倍。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You heal twice as much from potions."
msgstr "你从药水获得的治疗加倍了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer heal twice as much from potions."
msgstr "你从药水获得的治疗不再加倍。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Whenever you drink a healing potion, you attack all around you."
msgstr "每当你饮用治疗药水时，都会攻击周围的所有敌人。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You brawl whenever you drink a healing potion."
msgstr "每当你饮用治疗药水时，都会发起乱斗。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer brawl whenever you drink a healing potion."
msgstr "你不再在饮用治疗药水时发起乱斗。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can use scrolls of enchantment on lesser artefacts."
msgstr "你能对低等神器使用附魔卷轴。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can now use scrolls of enchantment on lesser artefacts."
msgstr "你现在能对低等神器使用附魔卷轴了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can no longer use scrolls of enchantment on lesser artefacts."
msgstr "你无法再对低等神器使用附魔卷轴。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your spellcasting is much less encumbered by armour."
msgstr "防具对你施法的妨碍大幅减少。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your spellcasting becomes less encumbered by armour."
msgstr "防具对你施法的妨碍减轻了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your spellcasting no longer less encumbered by armour."
msgstr "防具对你施法的妨碍不再减轻。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can equip up to 6 pieces of aux armour in any combination."
msgstr "你能以任意组合装备最多6件辅助防具。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can equip up to 6 pieces of aux armour in any combination and unleash them."
msgstr "你能以任意组合装备最多6件辅助防具，并将它们释放出去。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel ready to unleash a true cacophony."
msgstr "你感到自己已准备好释放真正的不谐狂响。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You will be able to unleash your equipped armour."
msgstr "你将能够释放已装备的防具。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You gain AC when you inflict magical misfortune on nearby enemies."
msgstr "对附近敌人施加魔法厄运时，你会获得护甲值。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You can enhance your damage-dealing spells by burning harvested memories."
msgstr "你能燃烧收集的记忆，强化伤害法术。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your flames flicker hungrily."
msgstr "你的火焰饥渴地闪烁。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your flames grow less ravenous."
msgstr "你的火焰不再那么饥渴了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You will be able to burn memories to enhance your damage-dealing spells."
msgstr "你将能够燃烧记忆来强化伤害法术。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You perform a melee attack whenever you cast damage-dealing spells."
msgstr "每当你施放伤害法术时，都会发起一次近战攻击。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel destructive magic coursing through your claws."
msgstr "你感到毁灭魔法在利爪中流淌。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You no longer feel destructive magic coursing through your claws."
msgstr "你不再感到毁灭魔法在利爪中流淌。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You recover more slowly from Doom and Banes."
msgstr "你从厄运和灾厄中恢复得更慢。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel accursed."
msgstr "你感到受到诅咒。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel less accursed."
msgstr "你感到诅咒减轻了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your shed blood may rise up to attack you."
msgstr "你洒落的鲜血可能站起来攻击你。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your shed blood may rise up to attack you as a group."
msgstr "你洒落的鲜血可能成群站起来攻击你。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel a willful anger gathering in your blood."
msgstr "你感到鲜血中聚起了顽固的怒火。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your blood grow even more spiteful."
msgstr "你感到鲜血变得更加怨毒。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your blood calms down again."
msgstr "你的鲜血再次平静了下来。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "Your blood feels a little less spiteful."
msgstr "你的鲜血似乎不那么怨毒了。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You draw destruction from the endless fires of Gehenna."
msgstr "你从欣嫩谷无尽的烈焰中汲取毁灭之力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your soul grow hot with the fiery destruction of Gehenna."
msgstr "欣嫩谷炽热的毁灭使你的灵魂变得灼热。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You draw destruction from the frigid wastes of Cocytus."
msgstr "你从悲叹河冰冷的荒原中汲取毁灭之力。"

msgctxt "m.mutation"
msgid "You feel your soul grow cold with the frigid destruction of Cocytus."
