msgctxt "p.ui"
msgid "Your willpower is stripped away!"
msgstr "你的意志力被剥夺了！"

msgctxt "p.ui"
msgid "You feel your power leaking away."
msgstr "你感觉力量正在流失。"

msgctxt "p.ui"
msgid "Your body becomes as fragile as glass!"
msgstr "你的身体变得如玻璃般脆弱！"

msgctxt "p.ui"
msgid "You feel your fragility will last longer."
msgstr "你感觉脆弱将持续更久。"

msgctxt "p.ui"
msgid "You savour every drop."
