msgstr "你的视野重新获得了神赐的洞察。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s restores the support of your attributes."
msgstr "%s恢复了对你属性的支持。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "A storm instantly forms around you!"
msgstr "一场风暴瞬间在你周围形成！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your full life essence returns."
msgstr "你的生命精华完全恢复了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your water-walking will last only until you reach solid ground."
msgstr "你的水上行走能力只能维持到你回到坚实地面为止。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your divine halo fades away."
msgstr "你的神圣光环消退了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your aura of darkness fades away."
msgstr "你的黑暗光晕消退了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "The storm surrounding you dissipates."
msgstr "你周围的风暴消散了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your resistance to fire fades away."
msgstr "你的火焰抗性消退了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your resistance to cold fades away."
msgstr "你的寒冷抗性消退了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your resistance to electricity fades away."
msgstr "你的电击抗性消退了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your resistance to physical damage fades away."
msgstr "你对物理伤害的抗性消退了。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s deals you some cards!"
msgstr "%s发给你一些卡牌！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s alters your body."
msgstr "%s改变了你的身体。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s grants you throwing weapons!"
msgstr "%s赐予你投掷武器！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s grants you a weapon!"
msgstr "%s赐予你一把武器！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s grants you bugs!"
msgstr "%s赐予你程序错误！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "...but nothing appears."
msgstr "……但什么也没出现。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You feel as though nothing has changed."
msgstr "你觉得似乎什么也没有改变。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s grants you a gift!"
msgstr "%s赐予你一份礼物！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s has no new spells for you at this time."
msgstr "%s此时没有新的法术可赐予你。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "A divine halo surrounds you!"
msgstr "一道神圣光环笼罩着你！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You are shrouded in an aura of darkness!"
msgstr "你被黑暗光晕笼罩了！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s begins accelerating your health and magic regeneration."
msgstr "%s开始加快你的生命和魔力再生。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s will now unseal the treasures of the Slime Pits."
msgstr "%s现在将解封史莱姆巢穴中的宝藏。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You may now remember your ancestor's life."
msgstr "你现在可以回忆先祖的生平了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your curses shatter."
msgstr "你的诅咒粉碎了。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s's gift of slime is revoked."
msgstr "%s收回了赐予你的胶质恩赐。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You have lost your religion!"
msgstr "你失去了信仰！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s blazes with a vengeful fury!"
msgstr "%s燃起了复仇的怒火！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You sense decay."
msgstr "你感受到了腐朽。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s's voice booms out: Traitor to your kin!"
msgstr "%s的声音轰然响起：背叛同族的叛徒！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "All of your followers decide to abandon you."
msgstr "你的所有追随者都决定抛弃你。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "All of your fellow slimes turn on you."
msgstr "所有与你为伴的史莱姆都与你反目。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "The plants of the dungeon turn on you."
msgstr "地下城中的植物都与你反目。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your funded stores close, unable to pay their debts without your funds."
msgstr "你资助的商店失去资金支持，无力偿债，纷纷关门。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your storm instantly dissipates."
msgstr "你的风暴瞬间消散了。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s continues to slow your movements."
msgstr "%s继续减缓你的移动。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s burns away your resistance to fire."
msgstr "%s烧掉了你的火焰抗性。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your cloak of flame burns out."
msgstr "你的火焰披风燃尽了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your rising flame fizzles out."
msgstr "你的升腾之焰熄灭了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your amulet flashes!"
msgstr "你的护身符闪了一下！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You pay a service fee of %d gold."
msgstr "你支付了 %d 金币的服务费。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s waives the service fee."
msgstr "%s免除了服务费。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Your summoned allies are dismissed!"
msgstr "你召唤的盟友被遣散了！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "Zin cleanses your body of Beogh's taint."
msgstr "辛清除了你身上比欧弗的污秽。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s begins to support your attributes as your movement slows."
msgstr "%s开始在你的移动减缓时提升你的属性。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "The plants of the dungeon cease their hostilities."
msgstr "地下城中的植物不再敌视你。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You bow before the missionary of Beogh."
msgstr "你向比欧弗的传教士鞠躬。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s refuses to forgive you so easily!"
msgstr "%s不肯轻易原谅你！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s does not accept service from beggars like you!"
msgstr "%s不接受你这样的乞丐效劳！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "The service fee for joining is currently %d gold; you have none."
msgstr "入教服务费目前为 %d 金币；你身无分文。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "The service fee for joining is currently %d gold; you only have %d."
msgstr "入教服务费目前为 %d 金币；你只有 %d 金币。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s does not accept worship from the loveless!"
msgstr "%s不接受无爱之人的信奉！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s says: You must forswear the aid of any and all before you are fit to worship."
msgstr "%s说：你必须放弃一切援助，才配成为信徒。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s says: How dare you approach in such a loathsome form!"
msgstr "%s说：你竟敢以如此可憎的形态前来！"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s does not accept worship from those such as you!"
msgstr "%s不接受你这样的人信奉！"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You feel a momentary loss of self-confidence."
msgstr "你感到自信短暂地动摇了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "...but the rich have no need for faith."
msgstr "……但富人不需要信仰。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "...but you know Xom will still be watching."
msgstr "……但你知道佐姆仍会注视着你。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "...but the divine are already as distant as possible."
msgstr "……但诸神已经疏远得不能再疏远了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You feel the divine grow more distant."
msgstr "你感到诸神更加疏远了。"

msgctxt "r.ui"
msgid "You feel the divine notice you fully once more."
msgstr "你感到诸神再次充分关注你了。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "r.power.wrapper"
msgid "You can now %s."
msgstr "你现在可以%s。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "r.power.wrapper"
msgid "You can no longer %s."
msgstr "你不能再%s了。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Zin will now cleanse your potions of mutation."
msgstr "辛现在将净化你的变异药水。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Zin will no longer cleanse your potions of mutation."
msgstr "辛不再净化你的变异药水。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Zin will cleanse your potions of mutation."
msgstr "辛会净化你的变异药水。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You and your allies can now gain power from killing the unholy and evil."
msgstr "你和盟友现在可以通过击杀不洁与邪恶之物获得力量。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You and your allies can no longer gain power from killing the unholy and evil."
msgstr "你和盟友不再能通过击杀不洁与邪恶之物获得力量。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You and your allies can gain power from killing the unholy and evil."
msgstr "你与你的盟友可以通过杀死不洁与邪恶生物获取力量。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "The Shining One will bless your weapon with holy wrath... once."
msgstr "光明神将以神圣之怒祝福你的武器……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "The Shining One is no longer ready to bless your weapon."
msgstr "光明神不再准备祝福你的武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha is now protecting you from necromantic miscasts and death curses."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈现在会保护你免受死灵法术失误与死亡诅咒的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha will no longer protect you from necromantic miscasts or death curses."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈不再保护你免受死灵法术失误或死亡诅咒的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha protects you from necromantic miscasts and death curses."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈保护你免受死灵魔法误施与死亡诅咒的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha is now protecting you from unholy torment."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈现在会保护你免受不洁折磨。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha will no longer protect you from unholy torment."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈不再保护你免受不洁折磨。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha protects you from unholy torment."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈保护你免受邪恶的折磨。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha will grant you forbidden knowledge or bloody your weapon with pain... once."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈将赐予你禁忌知识，或以痛苦染血你的武器……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha is no longer ready to enhance your necromancy."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈不再准备增强你的死灵魔法。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha will grant you forbidden knowledge."
msgstr "奇库巴库哈将赐予你禁忌知识。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Yredelemnul will now gift you temporary undead servants when you light the torch."
msgstr "伊莱德莱姆努尔现在会在你点燃黑炬时赐予你临时的亡灵仆从。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Yredelemnul will no longer gift you temporary undead servants when you light the torch."
msgstr "伊莱德莱姆努尔不再在你点燃黑炬时赐予你临时的亡灵仆从。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Yredelemnul will gift you temporary undead servants when you light the torch."
msgstr "点燃火炬时，伊莱德莱姆努尔会赐予你临时的亡灵仆从。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet is now aiding your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特现在会增强你的毁灭性法术。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet will no longer aid your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特不再增强你的毁灭性法术。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet aids your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特增强你的毁灭性法术。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet is now extending the range of your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特现在会延长你的毁灭性法术的射程。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet will no longer extend the range of your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特不再延长你的毁灭性法术的射程。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Vehumet extends the range of your destructive spells."
msgstr "维胡梅特延长你的毁灭性法术的射程。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru requires that you fight alone, and prevents you from gaining allies."
msgstr "奥格瓦如要求你独自战斗，使你无法获得盟友。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru will now gift you throwing weapons as you gain piety."
msgstr "奥格瓦如现在会在你的虔诚提升时赐予你投掷武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru will no longer gift you throwing weapons."
msgstr "奥格瓦如不再赐予你投掷武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru will gift you throwing weapons as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，奥格瓦如会赐予你投掷武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru will grant you a choice of weapons... once."
msgstr "奥格瓦如将让你挑选一件武器……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru is no longer ready to gift you weaponry."
msgstr "奥格瓦如不再准备赐予你武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru will grant you a choice of armour... once."
msgstr "奥格瓦如将让你挑选一件防具……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Okawaru is no longer ready to gift you armour."
msgstr "奥格瓦如不再准备赐予你防具。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Makhleb will allow you to brand your body with an infernal mark... once."
msgstr "马科列布将允许你在身上烙印地狱印记……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Makhleb will no longer allow you to brand your body with an infernal mark."
msgstr "马科列布不再允许你在身上烙下地狱印记。"

msgctxt "d.god.power"
msgid "forget spells at will"
msgstr "随意遗忘法术"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Sif Muna will now gift you books as you gain piety."
msgstr "席夫·穆纳现在会在你的虔诚提升时赐予你魔法书。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Sif Muna will no longer gift you books."
msgstr "席夫·穆纳不再赐予你魔法书。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Sif Muna will gift you books as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，席夫·穆纳会赐予你法术书。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Trog will now gift you melee weapons as you gain piety."
msgstr "特洛戈现在会在你的虔诚提升时赐予你近战武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Trog will no longer gift you weapons."
msgstr "特洛戈不再赐予你武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Trog will gift you melee weapons as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，特洛戈会赐予你近战武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Nemelex will now gift you decks of power as you gain piety."
msgstr "尼姆雷斯现在会在你的虔诚提升时赐予你力量牌组。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Nemelex will no longer gift you decks."
msgstr "尼姆雷斯不再赐予你牌组。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Nemelex will gift you decks of power as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，尼姆雷斯・索布会赐予你力量牌组。"

msgctxt "d.god.power"
msgid "stack cards"
msgstr "叠放卡牌"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Lugonu protects you from the effects of unwielding distortion weapons."
msgstr "卢戈努保护你免受放下扭曲武器的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Lugonu may banish nearby foes when other gods try to punish you."
msgstr "其他神祇试图惩罚你时，卢戈努可能放逐附近的敌人。"

msgctxt "d.god.power"
msgid "depart the Abyss at will"
msgstr "随意离开深渊"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Lugonu will corrupt your weapon with distortion... once."
msgstr "卢戈努将以扭曲之力腐化你的武器……仅此一次。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Lugonu is no longer ready to corrupt your weapon."
msgstr "卢戈努不再准备腐化你的武器。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Beogh will now send orc apostles to challenge you in battle as you gain piety."
msgstr "比欧弗现在会在你的虔诚提升时派遣兽人使徒向你挑战。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Beogh will no longer send orc apostles to challenge you in battle."
msgstr "比欧弗不再派遣兽人使徒向你挑战。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Beogh will send orc apostles to challenge you in battle as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，比欧弗会派遣兽人使徒前来挑战你。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You can recruit apostles that you defeat into your service."
msgstr "你可以招募被你击败的使徒为你效力。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Your apostles are sometimes healed when you deal damage."
msgstr "当你造成伤害时，你的使徒有时会得到治疗。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva is now protecting you from corrosive effects."
msgstr "吉瓦现在会保护你免受腐蚀效果的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva will no longer protect you from corrosive effects."
msgstr "吉瓦不再保护你免受腐蚀效果的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva protects you from corrosive effects."
msgstr "吉瓦保护你免受腐蚀效果影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva will now mutate your body as you gain piety."
msgstr "吉瓦现在会在你的虔诚提升时改变你的身体变异。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva will no longer mutate your body."
msgstr "吉瓦不再改变你的身体变异。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Jiyva will mutate your body as you gain piety."
msgstr "随着你的虔诚增长，吉瓦会使你的身体发生变异。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You may now expel jellies when seriously injured."
msgstr "你现在可能在重伤时排出胶怪。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You will no longer expel jellies when injured."
msgstr "你不再在受伤时排出胶怪。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You may expel jellies when seriously injured."
msgstr "你受到重伤时可能释放出软泥怪。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "You can walk through plants and fire through allied plants."
msgstr "你可以穿过植物，并让攻击穿过友方植物。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Cheibriados is now slowing the effects of poison on you."
msgstr "切布理亚多现在会减缓毒素对你的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Cheibriados will no longer slow the effects of poison on you."
msgstr "切布理亚多不再减缓毒素对你的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Cheibriados slows the effects of poison on you."
msgstr "切布理亚多延缓毒素对你的作用。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari warns you of distant threats and treasures.\nAshenzari shows you where magical portals lie."
msgstr "艾申扎利会警告你远处的威胁与宝藏。\n艾申扎利会指示魔法传送门的位置。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will now identify your possessions."
msgstr "艾申扎利现在会鉴定你的物品。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will no longer identify your possesions."
msgstr "艾申扎利不再鉴定你的物品。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari identifies your possessions."
msgstr "艾申扎利鉴定你拥有的物品。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will now reveal the unseen."
msgstr "艾申扎利现在会揭示隐形之物。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will no longer reveal the unseen."
msgstr "艾申扎利不再揭示隐形之物。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari reveals the unseen."
msgstr "艾申扎利揭示不可见的事物。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will now keep your mind clear."
msgstr "艾申扎利现在会使你保持头脑清醒。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will no longer keep your mind clear."
msgstr "艾申扎利不再使你保持头脑清醒。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari keeps your mind clear."
msgstr "艾申扎利使你保持头脑清醒。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari will now protect you from the dungeon's malevolent forces."
msgstr "艾申扎利现在会保护你免受地下城中恶意力量的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari no longer protects you from the dungeon's malevolent forces."
msgstr "艾申扎利不再保护你免受地下城中恶意力量的影响。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari protects you from the dungeon's malevolent forces."
msgstr "艾申扎利保护你免受地下城中恶意力量的侵扰。"

msgctxt "r.power"
msgid "Ashenzari reveals the structure of the nearby dungeon."
msgstr "艾申扎利揭示附近地下城的结构。"

