msgstr "%s从地下唤出了可怜的濒死者！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Please don't blink into the map border."
msgstr "请不要闪现到地图边界中。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Please don't try to blink into monsters."
msgstr "请不要尝试闪现到怪物身体里。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Boing!"
msgstr "嗖！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Even you can't go there right now. Sorry!"
msgstr "即使是你，现在也不能去那里。抱歉！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You cannot see any enemies that you can affect. Speak a word of chaos anyway?"
msgstr "你看不到任何能影响的敌人。仍然说出混沌真言吗？"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "A tree falls to the furious winds!"
msgstr "一棵树被狂风刮倒了！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The freezing vortex lifts you up."
msgstr "冰冻涡流将你托起。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Enter next level anyway?"
msgstr "仍然进入下一层吗？"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The world spins around you as you enter the gateway."
msgstr "你进入传送门时，周围的世界旋转起来。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "A mysterious force pulls you upwards."
msgstr "一股神秘力量将你向上拉去。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The hatch slams shut behind you."
msgstr "活板门在你身后砰然关闭。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You ooze up the stairs."
msgstr "你化作胶质涌上楼梯。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You slide down the stairs, becoming coated in regenerative ooze."
msgstr "你滑下楼梯，身上裹满了能促进再生的胶质。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You have passed through the Ziggurat. Zot will hunt you nevermore."
msgstr "你穿过了通天塔。佐特再也不会追猎你。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "There is nothing on the other side of the stone arch."
msgstr "石拱门的另一边什么也没有。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "This shop has been abandoned, nothing of value remains."
msgstr "这家商店已被遗弃，没留下任何有价值的东西。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You can't go up here!"
msgstr "这里无法上去！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You can't go down here!"
msgstr "这里无法下去！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The lock glows eerily!"
msgstr "锁发出诡异的光芒！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Heavy smoke blows from the lock!"
msgstr "浓烟从锁中喷出！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The gate opens wide!"
msgstr "大门敞开了！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "With a soft hiss the gate opens wide!"
msgstr "随着一声轻轻的嘶响，大门敞开了！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The nature of this place prevents you from teleporting."
msgstr "此地的特性阻止你传送。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You feel stable on this floor."
msgstr "你感到在这层楼中很稳定。"

#, c-format
msgctxt "log.god"
msgid "%s's power protects you from the chaos of Hell!"
msgstr "%s的力量保护你免受地狱混沌的侵袭！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You announce your regal presence to all who would look upon you."
msgstr "你向所有注视你的人宣告自己的威严。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The shaft disappears in a puff of logic!"
msgstr "竖井在一阵逻辑中消失了！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Strange, the shaft seems to lead back to this level."
msgstr "奇怪，竖井似乎通回了这一层。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The strain on the space-time continuum destroys the shaft!"
msgstr "时空连续体的扭曲摧毁了竖井！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The shaft crumbles and collapses."
msgstr "竖井崩塌了。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "With a burst of heat and light, you rocket upward!"
msgstr "随着一阵炽热光芒，你猛冲而上！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "In a burst of heat and light, you rocket briefly upward... but you can't rise from here."
msgstr "你在炽热光芒中短暂冲起……但无法从这里升上去。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Your cacophony subsides as you depart the area."
msgstr "随着你离开此地，不谐狂响平息了。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You have escaped!"
msgstr "你逃脱了！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Thank you for visiting Hell. Please come again soon."
msgstr "感谢光临地狱。欢迎再次到来。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You pass through the gate."
msgstr "你穿过了大门。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You plunge deeper into the Abyss."
msgstr "你深入了深渊。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The abyssal rune of Zot can be found at this depth."
msgstr "在这一深度可以找到深渊佐特符文。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You enter the Abyss!"
msgstr "你进入了深渊！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "To return, you must find a gate leading back."
msgstr "你必须找到通往外界的门才能返回。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Killing monsters will force the Abyss to allow you passage."
msgstr "击杀怪物将迫使深渊允许你通过。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You pass into a different region of Pandemonium."
msgstr "你进入了魔窟的另一片区域。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Zot already knows this place too well. Descend or flee this branch!"
msgstr "佐特对这里已了如指掌。继续向下或逃离此分支！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Zot's attention fixes on you again. Descend or flee this branch!"
msgstr "佐特再次盯上了你。继续向下或逃离此分支！"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Zot has no power in the Abyss."
msgstr "佐特在深渊中没有力量。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "You feel Zot lose track of you."
msgstr "你感到佐特失去了你的踪迹。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "The door slams shut behind you."
msgstr "门在你身后砰然关闭。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Beware, you cannot shaft yourself on this level."
msgstr "注意，这一层无法自行制造竖井。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Your search expression is invalid."
msgstr "你的搜索表达式无效。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Can't find anything matching that."
msgstr "找不到任何匹配项。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "Too many matches; use a more specific search."
msgstr "匹配项太多；请缩小搜索范围。"

msgctxt "s.ui"
msgid "<lightgrey>: only useless items found; press <w>=</w> to show.                    </lightgrey>"
msgstr "<lightgrey>：只找到无用物品；按 <w>=</w> 显示。</lightgrey>"

