msgid "you don't have enough health to cast this spell."
msgstr "你没有足够的生命来施放这个法术。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you don't have enough magic to cast this spell."
msgstr "你没有足够的魔力来施放这个法术。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your magic and health are inextricable."
msgstr "你的魔力和生命无法分离。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your reserves of magic are already full."
msgstr "你的魔力储备已经充满了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot cast such powerful magic in your current form."
msgstr "你当前的形态无法施放如此强大的魔法。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot use spells of this school."
msgstr "你无法使用这个学派的法术。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot coerce anything to answer your summons."
msgstr "你无法强迫任何生物响应召唤。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot coerce anything to obey you."
msgstr "你无法强迫任何生物服从你。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you can't cast spells right now."
msgstr "你现在无法施法。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you can't see any hostile targets that would be affected."
msgstr "你看不到任何会受到影响的敌对目标。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your stasis prevents you from teleporting."
msgstr "稳态阻止了你传送。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are still too unstable to blink."
msgstr "你仍然太不稳定，无法闪现。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your stasis precludes magical swiftness."
msgstr "稳态阻止你通过魔法加快脚步。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "this spell is already in effect."
msgstr "这个法术已经生效了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you're already travelling as fast as you can."
msgstr "你已经在以最快速度移动了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you can't move."
msgstr "你无法移动。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "this spell is useless without hands."
msgstr "没有手就无法使用这个法术。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you need to wait for the ground to become solid again."
msgstr "你需要等地面重新变得坚实。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot be healed further."
msgstr "你无法再被治疗了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you lack the resilience to cast this spell."
msgstr "你缺少施放这个法术所需的生命韧性。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you're too dead."
msgstr "你已经是亡灵了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are already standing in death's doorway."
msgstr "你已站在死亡之门前。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are still too close to death's doorway."
msgstr "你仍然离死亡之门太近。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your ring of flames would instantly melt the ice."
msgstr "你的烈焰之环会立即融化冰层。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you have no blood to sublime."
msgstr "你没有可供升华的血液。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you need to wait for the winds to calm down."
msgstr "你需要等待狂风平息。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "the dungeon can only cope with one malign gateway at a time."
msgstr "地下城一次只能容纳一个恶意之门。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you need more open space to create a gateway."
msgstr "你需要更开阔的空间才能创造传送门。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you can only summon one forest at a time."
msgstr "你一次只能召唤一片森林。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you need more open space to fit a forest."
msgstr "你需要更开阔的空间才能容纳森林。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you aren't next to any passable walls."
msgstr "你身旁没有可以穿过的墙壁。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you're being held away from the wall."
msgstr "你被拉住了，无法靠近墙壁。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "necromancy does not work on golden corpses."
msgstr "死灵魔法对黄金尸体无效。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are already reaping souls!"
msgstr "你已经在收割灵魂了！"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are already channelling the dead."
msgstr "你已经在引导亡者了。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "the air is too still for clouds to form."
msgstr "空气太过静止，无法形成云雾。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "a magic seal in the Gauntlet prevents this spell from working."
msgstr "竞技场中的魔法封印使这个法术无法生效。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot issue another dragon's call so soon."
msgstr "你无法这么快再次发出巨龙呼唤。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot sustain more frozen ramparts right now."
msgstr "你目前无法维持更多冰霜壁垒。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot sustain more bogs right now."
msgstr "你目前无法维持更多毒沼。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot wear body armour."
msgstr "你无法穿戴躯干防具。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you have no body armour to summon the spirit of."
msgstr "你没有可供唤出灵体的躯干防具。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot redirect your momentum while unable to move."
msgstr "无法移动时，你不能改变动量的方向。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your stasis prevents you from launching yourself."
msgstr "稳态阻止你弹射自己。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot launch yourself while unable to move."
msgstr "无法移动时，你不能弹射自己。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot see anything nearby that you can launch."
msgstr "你看不到附近有可以弹射的目标。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "there is no room nearby to place a sigil."
msgstr "附近没有放置印记的空间。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "your canine familiar is too injured to answer your call."
msgstr "你的犬类使魔伤势太重，无法响应呼唤。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "local gravity is still too unstable to reorient."
msgstr "当地的重力仍然太不稳定，无法重新定向。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you are already unleashing a barrage of alchemical concoctions!"
msgstr "你已经在释放炼金混合物的齐射了！"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you must wait for your last cast of this to end!"
msgstr "你必须等上一次施法的效果结束！"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you cannot see far enough to hit anything with this spell."
msgstr "你的视野不够远，无法用这个法术击中目标。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "you must harvest more living souls to recharge this spell."
msgstr "你必须收割更多活物的灵魂，为这个法术充能。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
msgid "there are no nearby walls to construct a spike launcher in."
msgstr "附近没有可用于构造尖刺发射器的墙壁。"

msgctxt "s.reason"
