#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "That's more like it."
msgstr "这才像话。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "This should be good."
msgstr "这下有好戏看了。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Let me show you the power of Hell."
msgstr "让我向你展示地狱的力量。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Embrace the darkness."
msgstr "拥抱黑暗吧。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Isn't this worth a little damnation?"
msgstr "这难道还不值得受点天谴吗？"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I'll handle this."
msgstr "交给我吧。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Now here's how it's done."
msgstr "看好了，这才是正确的做法。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Your soul is simply delicious."
msgstr "你的灵魂真是美味。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Has anyone ever told you how good your soul tastes?"
msgstr "有人告诉过你，你的灵魂有多好吃吗？"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "You're beginning to bore me."
msgstr "你开始让我感到无聊了。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "My talents are wasted here."
msgstr "我的才华全浪费在这里了。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Why bother with such petty cantrips?"
msgstr "何必费心施展这种微不足道的戏法？"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "A demon of Hell at your fingers, and you cast that..."
msgstr "地狱的恶魔任你驱使，你却只施展这种法术……"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Now, try casting something FUN."
msgstr "现在，试着施展点有趣的东西。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "At last; a crown worthy of my station."
msgstr "终于有一顶配得上我身份的冠冕了。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "A good hat truly is one of the finest things in life or death."
msgstr "一顶好帽子，确实是生前死后最美好的事物之一。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I applaud your taste in fashion, my scion."
msgstr "我的传人，你的衣着品味值得赞许。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Our enemies shall surely prostrate themselves before my majesty now."
msgstr "这下，我们的敌人定会拜倒在我的威严面前。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "A suitable chapeau."
msgstr "一顶合适的帽子。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "An acceptable crown. For now."
msgstr "一顶尚可接受的冠冕。暂且如此。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "The magic in this cap shall complement my own adequately."
msgstr "这顶帽子的魔力，倒也足以与我的力量相辅相成。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "How dare you fob such a shabby cap upon my head!"
msgstr "你竟敢往我头上塞这么一顶破帽子！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "What an insult, to strut around in such shoddy millinery."
msgstr "戴着如此粗劣的帽子招摇过市，简直是侮辱。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Bah, this is suited for peasants, not a master of souls."
msgstr "呸，这适合农夫，可不适合灵魂的主宰。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "How lamentable, to be reduced to wearing... this."
msgstr "可悲啊，竟沦落到要戴上……这种东西。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I can see much more clearly than that foolish titan prince!"
msgstr "我可比那个愚蠢的泰坦王子看得清楚多了！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "The purity of bronze and the beauty of gems: a fitting combination."
msgstr "青铜的纯净与宝石的美丽：多么相称的组合。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Let us go off to war, my scion!"
msgstr "我的传人，随我出征吧！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "My scion, our enemies will not go gentle into that good night!"
msgstr "我的传人，我们的敌人可不会温顺地走进那良夜！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Rage, rage against the shining of the light!"
msgstr "怒斥吧，怒斥那光明的照耀！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Our combined strength is more than our foes can bear!"
msgstr "你我合力，敌人岂能承受！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Be a stabber in the dark, treacherous to foes!"
msgstr "做个暗中的行刺者，令敌人防不胜防！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Four thousand throats may be cut in one night by a running man."
msgstr "奔行之人，一夜便能割开四千条喉咙。"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Ah, the thrill of more efficient killing!"
msgstr "啊，更有效率的杀戮，何等快意！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "A mask of a dragon worshipper? I shall make the dragons worship me!"
msgstr "拜龙者的面具？我会让巨龙来崇拜我！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Such primal killing power, scion...."
msgstr "如此原始的杀戮之力，我的传人……"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Be of strong will, and bring death to all who oppose us!"
msgstr "意志坚定些，将死亡带给所有与我们为敌的人！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Ah, alchemy. So many new and exciting ways to cause harm...."
msgstr "啊，炼金术。能造成伤害的新奇方法真多……"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "All our enemies can now be test subjects!"
msgstr "现在，所有敌人都能成为实验对象！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Even if you find the elixir of immortality, remember: I was immortal first!"
msgstr "即便找到长生不老药，也要记住：我比你更早获得永生！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Scion, are you pondering what I'm pondering?"
msgstr "我的传人，你在想我正在想的事吗？"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I can tolerate a stained cap for power such as this!"
msgstr "为了这样的力量，我可以容忍一顶脏帽子！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I must contemplate what to do next...."
msgstr "我得思考一下接下来该做什么……"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "All will be laid low in my presence!"
msgstr "所有人都将在我面前倒下！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "I can tolerate light if it grants the power to send my enemies to eternal darkness!"
msgstr "只要能把敌人送入永恒的黑暗，我可以容忍光明！"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "a.speech"
msgid "Kill for my glory, not yours, scion!"
msgstr "为我的荣耀杀戮，而非你的荣耀，我的传人！"

